<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachenganchepaw tawngbak mih Jihudi Kristianuüa mih risi Jeremiah ruiah mih naown pahai ka tuak khai. Now arui khin dow 560-536 BC takra kowi chekhai. 1 hai 2 Manguüa bowih mih auown khe dow pabowih sang chowdiah; tawkche akung kowi dow ta changah pre bowih khai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa hai pur prakowi kowh maru-uüa vüi kowi ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow mang David kowh chownglawng chur pra kowh lawnguan, mang Sawlawmawn kowh chownglawng klangiung mih lawnguan hai pren tabak mih kowi kowh chenchapuüa lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mang David kowng kung kowi dow achapa Sawlawmawn mih ta chowm mang khai, now Mang Sawlawmawn kowng kung kowi dow Israel pren mih ta chowng pre bak khai. Pabak mih dow mrawkphak pra kowh Juda pren, now nakowi kowh rik chowm mang mih dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam chekhai. Now pabak mih dow tawngphak pra kowh Israel pren, now nakowi kowh rik chowm mang mih dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh alowk mih chapa Jeroboam chekhai. Kowiüah pre ia kung kowi dow Israel pren hai Juda pren kowi mih manguüa akawmma ta kruitown pren khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow pre pren manguüa chün Thurai lai mih hai chün Thurai lai dowi mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi, now risi Elija kowh lup lawnguan paw arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Manguüa bowih kowi lang pankri mih tüngsangra dow lusa manguüa mih tawng khe paw ia thawp Thurai pren dowi chekhai. Lusa manguüa dow tawng khe paw Thurai iawng ia kruitown maru dowi. Naiawng rakowi Isu matia ngengche mih uang chowng mang takla khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Chawnlawng: Chawnlawng pami dow sata kowi kowh krawi mang reng mih aiukma mih lawng chekhai. Naiawng mih lawng dow khawr hown kowh mang mih chaing chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Laksma: Laksma pami dow uanh thawp kiakma mih maru kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Angak: Angak pami dow auan uowi huma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Thurai mik kowi kowh angak dow aia hangah mih lup chang, aia ana pek chün dowi mih chekhai. Thurai mik kowi kowh angakma mih maru kowh ripra dow kowngra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kingküa: Kingküa pami dow lowkkowlowk naukhi dowi iawng chang lup mih hai lowkkowlowk tapiak kownkow chang lup mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang David kowh chownglawng chur pra 1:1-2:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh chownglawng klangiung krang 2:12-11:43</para>
  <para style="io1">Pren tabak pre bak mih kowi kowh chenchap uowi mih 12:1-22:53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Adonija chowm mang kown kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Mang David kowh dow ning hu mih nowm khowk chekhai. Aia kowh kow dow khup pe uan ahuma chepaw ia den dowi bowt. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mang David mih, “Mangkri ow, naming nakhet en kownkow kachakuüa hown taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa anging krawi cham en lowk ia kown chaw. En kowh kow naia denla kownkow aia mih en ria kowi pacham tawi mawk lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Nahanow amatni dow Israel pren paprenma kowi malauüa klangiungma mih krawi cham büah lowk ia khai. Akung kowi amatni dow Sunem marow kowi kowh malauüa Abisag kowi khi büah khai, now mang tut-e Abisag kowi uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Nami malauüa dow lainowmma klangiung khai. Aia dow mang tut-e tawi uowi hanow mang kowi mingkhetah khai. Tawkchedow mang mih nami malauüa kowi phuaah iuaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Nami khin khe mang David kowh masi Hagit pami kowh chapa Adonija dow chang bawri se tek mih, “Ang towbowt chowm mang kown,” pakhai. Naiawng tekta hanow aia dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa ün krawi kram sangrum khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow aia pur kowi narik mang kown mih maru paw pawah 50 ia khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Adonija kowi dow tawng lup kowi paw David hangah dowi chekhai. Aia kowi dow, “Tawngplawng kowchow nami lup en tuk chang khai?” pami katpaw a-pa tek pe dowi. Aia paw Absalawm iawng dow apowm klangiungma, now aia dow Absalawm kung kowi kowh dia mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adonija mih aia nachowm mang kown mih lawnguan kowi natawi khowngah kownkow Zerui kowh chapa Joab hai uamow Abiathar iüah hown kowtalawp khai, now kowiüah paw Adonija kowi natawi khowngah kown mih nauta khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Nachenganchepaw uamow Zadawk, Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia, risi Nathan, Simei, Rei hai mang David kowh tasen kiakma miuüa dow Adonija hown tawi tabawng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adonija dow En-Rogel tuikuam re-e kowh Zohelet huamang ria kowi ruapur ün, chiala ün hai chia chah akauma mih ün hown chang phuchua pawi khai. Nami pawi kowi aia dow aia kowh tainau-uüa maten kowi hai Juda krungchak hownia maru iukuüa kowi hawla khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Tawkchedow aia mih risi Nathan, Benaia, David kowh tasen akiakma miuüa kowi hai anaumow Sawlawmawn kowi hawla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn kowh u Betseba kowi risi Nathan tek pe mih, “Mang David tawi tuk dowi matchang Hagit kowh chapa Adonija amatia low hown amatia chowm mang mih en tawi ta dowi bow? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Sünta, en hai en chapa Sawlawmawn tawng iawng chow asak naplai kown mih lawnguan kowi kawmat ang pe en prengia kown. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Kawmat en mih mang David tut-e kowkowiah now maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Ang kowh mangkri, en kung kowi en chapa Sawlawmawn nachowng mang ngengche kown mih hai en kowh mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kown mih en kowh narma ang tut-e en takham khowk nadowi bow? Naiawng now tawng rakowi chow Adonija taih dow chowng mang?’ pape diah. <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Naiawng mangkri hown en taklang mih khin khe ang paw nakowi uangah now tawi tangila en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Nahanow Betseba dow mang hown kowtakrum kownkow mang kim kowi kowkowi khai. (Nami khin khe mang dow alawngtangma khowk chekhai, now aia kowi mingkhetah mih dow Sunem marow hownia kowh Abisag chekhai). <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Betseba dow tabawkah krawm se mang kowi chupah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">Nakhowk khe mang lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en nau?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Now Betseba tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, en kung kowi en kowh chapa Sawlawmawn chowtaih nata chowm mang ngengche kown, now aia chowtaih en kowh mang chowm rah kowi nata chowm kown pami CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai ming hown takham se en tek ang khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Adonija mih pawta mangra khai bowt, now nami lawnguan kowi tawngpaw en tawi tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Aia dow chiala ün, chia iia akauma mih ün hai ruapur ün ahuma ngenah now chang phuchua pawi khai. Nami pawi kowi aia dow mang chapa maten kowi, uamow Abiathar kowi hai siphai aluchow mih Joab kowi hawla khai. Tawkche en kowh nar Sawlawmawn kowi dow aia hawla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Aw ang kowh mangkri, en kung kowi mia chow nata chowm mang kown mih en naphuangla kownkow Israeluüa maten chawng en khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Naiawng nadowi now en kowng kung kowi ang hai ang kowh chapa Sawlawmawn kowi maru nata tang angching aprek hanow nape angching ripra kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Now mang hown Betseba taklang mih chur kown chowbowt khe risi Nathan mih nami re-e uang tawi ting khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Nakhowk khe mang kowi maru iukuüa uang tek pe mih, “Risi Nathan uang ting khowk,” pakhai. Now risi Nathan mih tabawkah krawm se mang kowi uang chupah khai.<verse eid="1KI 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Nami kung kowi aia tek pe mang mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, en kung kowi Adonija nachowng mang kown mih hai en kowh mang chowm rah kowi aia natachowm kown mih en phuangta khai bowt bow? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Aia dow ani mih En-Rogel tuikuam re-e chiala ün, chia iia akauma mih ün, ruapur ün hown chang phuchua pawi khai. Nami pawi kowi aia dow mang chapauüa maten kowi, siphai aluchowuüa kowi hai uamow Abiathar kowi hawla khai. Amatni dow kawmat taiua cha taiua kham büah thüm chekhai. Now tek büah mih, ‘Mang Adonija mih chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi lah,’ pabüah khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow en kowh nar ang, uamow Zadawk, Jehoiada chapa Benaia hai en kowh nar Sawlawmawn kowi hawla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Tekla anging dowi matchang Adonija kowi en pe chowmah mang mih aching bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn chowng mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Nakhowk khe mang David tek pe Nathan mih, “Betseba kowi kowhaw madiah,” pakhai. Nahanow Betseba dow uang plan kup hanow mang pur kowi uang iowng khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Nakhowk khe mang tek pe mih, “Phih maten hownia kowh lawng ang reng mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk. <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ming hown ang kham en iawng ani mih ang nachang en ngengche kown. En kowh chapa Sawlawmawn mih ang kung kowi nachowng mang kown, now aia dow ang kowh mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Nakhowk khe Betseba mih tabawkah krawm se chupah now mang kowi tek pe mih, “Ang kowh mangkri David mih chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Nakhowk khe mang David tek mih, “Uamow Zadawk, risi Nathan hai Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowi ang re-e uang hawla diah,” pakhai. Nahanow amatni dow mang re-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Amatni kowi mang tek pe mih, “Ang kowh kangchawng miuüa kowi pawla now ang chapa Sawlawmawn kowi Gihawn tuikuam kowi kowpawla büa diah. Sawlawmawn kowi mih ang kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi pe chowmah büa diah. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Gihawn tuikuam kowi mih uamow Zadawk hai risi Nathan iüah Israel pren mang vüi Sawlawmawn kowi pacham nümnapah lah. Nami kung kowi dow tumla baw büah hanow atün atünma enni natek kown mih, ‘Mang Sawlawmawn mih chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi lah,’ pabüa diah. <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawlawmawn kung kowi tawi mang iualua se enni nauang plan kown. Sawlawmawn dow uang ting hanow ang kowh mang chowm rah kowi nauang chowm kown, now aia dow ang takcha kowi nachowm mang bowt kown. Aia kowi dow Israeluüa hai Judauüa luk kowi ang pe chowmah mang mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Nakhowk khe Jehoiada chapa Benaia tek pe mang mih, “Amen. CHAKRAMANG anging kowh mangkri kowh Thurai mih naiawng pacham chang lah. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh mangkri David tut-e kowh tawi uowi reng iawng Sawlawmawn tut-e paw pacham tawi uowi reng lah. Aia dow ang kowh mangkri David lak-e Sawlawmawn kowi kri kraingma mih mang pacham thawpah lah!” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Nami kung kowi dow uamow Zadawk, risi Nathan, Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia, David kowh kangchawng miuüa mih Sawlawmawn kowi mang David kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi pe chowmah now Gihawn tuikuam kowi kowpawla büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Now uamow Zadawk mih <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> kowi kowh chimsaima mih towklak kowi towah mih kanrawn sau nang hown uang pawla now Sawlawmawn kowi nümnapah khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow maru sangrum mih tum baw khai bowt, now maru kawm srui atünma tek mih, “Mang Sawlawmawn mih chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi lah,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Nami kung kowi dow maru maten mih tumla prui se hai apiaw apama plai se plai se Sawlawmawn kung uang tawi plan khai. Amatni piaw mih tün dow krawng khowm padow tahowng nurlur khai.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Naiawng phaw mih klow dow Adonija hai aia hawla pawi chak miuüa maten tawi ta khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni dow ki cha ki kham iawlaw khowk chekhai. Tata baw tün hanow Joab tek mih, “Marow kowi matawng klow chowbowt chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Joab kowh lai chur dowi how tak khe uamow Abiathar kowh chapa Jonathan dow nami re-e uang khai. Now Jonathan kowi Adonija tek pe mih, “Uang, uang. En dow maru iung chekhai. En uang pawla satang iung tangtang,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Nakhowk khe Jonathan klangah mih, “Mapaw nadowi. A-i kowh mang David mih Sawlawmawn kowi peta mangra tüng khowk. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Mangkri mih mang Sawlawmawn hown uamow Zadawk, risi Nathan, Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia, Keretuüa hai Peletuüa kowi tawi chin pe khai. Amatni dow Sawlawmawn kowi mih mang kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Now uamow Zadawk hai risi Nathan iüah mih aia kowi nathawpah mang kownkow Gihawn tuikuam kowi nümnapah khai. Nami hownia maru kawmuüa mih piawla pala se uang plan bowk khowk. Marow kowi kowh aklow akui enni ta mih dow nami klow chowbowt. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Nami klen kowi Sawlawmawn mih mang kowh chowm rah kowi paw chowm tüng khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Now mang kowh maru iukuüa mih a-i kowh mangkri David kowi uang tek pe awmrawm lai se tek mih, ‘En kowh Thurai mih en kowh lak-e Sawlawmawn kowi pacham peah ming iung nang iung lah, now en lak-e aia mih kri kraingma mih mang pacham phaw lah,’ pakhai. Nakhowk khe mang mih aia kowh phangbek luk kowi tabawk krawm se Thurai kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />‘CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ani dow ang kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm tataing mih kowi en pe khi ang khai bowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Adonija hawla pawi chak miuüa dow lainowmma kram khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow rü now chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Nachenganchepaw Sawlawmawn kowi kram kowh Adonija dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh phuchuara nang kowi kowtadowk chenchen khai. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn kowi maru lowk ia uang tek pe mih, “Adonija dow kram en kowh phuchuara nang kowi tadowk chenchen khai. Now aia tek mih, ‘Nakowngta ang dowi kownkow mang Sawlawmawn mih ani ang tut-e pacham kham sawi lah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawlawmawn tek pe mih, “Aia che maru iung pami nowng tatüng khai hanow aia kowh samiang aiangchow khowm padow nadowh kown nadowi; tawkche aia tut-e che angak uowi mih khi hanow aia nakowng ngengche kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Nami laiklow ki tekta hanow mang Sawlawmawn mih Adonija tut-e kowchin maru-uüa khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa mih phuchuara hownia Adonija kowi uang pawla khai. Adonija dow uang ting hanow tabawk krawm se mang Sawlawmawn kowi chupah khai. Now Sawlawmawn tek pe mih, “En matia kim kowi kowmang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowi David ta mala lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />David mih aia kowng kown mih khin tawn khowk khe achapa Sawlawmawn kowi ta mala lai khai. David tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Lusa kowi kowh maru maten kowng iawng ang paw nakowng kown towbowt. Naiawng rakowi sakkhawtma uowiah diah, now kowmatia kowi kachakuüa chah ching pami tatuakah diah. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai naukrang iawng aia tiama kowi en namang kown takla. Now Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow, ari aiang, ana pek hai alow pek maten en nachün kown takla. Naiawng che en chün khai hanow en cham kowi rah maten hai en changah mih lup maten nachawn kown. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih ang tut-e kowh aia takhamta mih maten nauang pe tachiah kown. Ang tut-e CHAKRAMANG takham mih, ‘En kowh krungchakuüa che tawng mih tiama kowi chow mang mih müah kaneu khai, amatni kowh sak maiow hown towsak towtaima kaah sakowmma ang pur kowi mang khai hanow Israel kowh mang chowm rah kowi nachowm mang kown mih maru en krungchak kowi nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Now ang luk kowi kowh Zerui kowh chapa Joab changah mih lawnguan en aiawng tuk towbowt. Aia dow Israeluüa kowh siphai aluchow pre ia Ner kowh chapa Abner kowi hai Jethar kowh chapa Amasa iüah kowi saiah khai. Aia dow thaulangma uowi khe paw tasen khe kowh iawng kowiüah kowi saiah khai. Kowiüah kowh vi dow aia kowh kekawm kowi hai phanaikhawk kowi ün krawi talük khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow en tut-e iung iawng changah diah. Tawkche aia kowi dow aiungma iawng mapaw hangkow pe kowngah.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Nachenganchepaw Gilead kowi kowh uowi mih Barzilai kowh chapauüa dow en taimow Absalawm hownia ang cham powt khe tawi khowng ang khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi dow kaah sakowm iawng uowi pe diah. Amatni kowi dow en kowh pawitang kowi tawi cha chakkham miuüa pungmadawng kowi pe chowmla diah.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Now Bahurim marow kowi kowh uowi mih Benjamin krungchak Gera kowh chapa Simei kowi sak kowi towah reng diah. Mahanaim marow kowi ang kowkowi khe aia dow lainowmma pe ang piati khai. Nachenganchepaw ang uang plan mih khin khe Jawrdan aw kowi ang tut-e aia uang khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowi nasaiah dowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG ming hown aia tut-e ang takhamta khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow en napeah ripra ngengche kown. En dow chanlaima chekhai; aia kowi tawng chow achang takla mih en tuk. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow en nasaiah kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih kowng khai bowt. Now aia kowh uak dow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Aia dow Israeluüa luk kowi 40 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. Aia dow Hebrawn marow kowi ranit ning, now Jerusalem marow kowi 33 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawlawmawn mih a-pa David kowh mang chowm rah kowi ta chowm mang khai, now aia kowh mangra dow akhawtma chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn saita Adonija mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13-14" />Akung kowi Hagit hown kowh David kaah mih chapa Adonija dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh u Betseba tut-e kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Adonija kowi Betseba hawt lüntaah mih, “Saktuak iungma hown en uang mih bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13-14">Adonija klangah mih, “Ow, saktuak iungma hown chowtaih ang uang. Ang tek en kown mih laiklow uowi ne,” pape khai. Now aia tek kown uowi mih dow Betseba pe tekah khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Nakhowk khe Adonija tek pe mih, “Israel pren kowi nachowm mang kown mih ang chowdiah pami en tuk. Israeluüa maten dow ang nachowm mang kown mih nauta bowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw naiawng phaw dowi kowi Israel pren kowi chowm mang mih dow ang naumow chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow CHAKRAMANG nauah kowh chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Now kawmat ang tek en lai lowk kown ang nau. Sakrauma hown ang tek en iawng chang ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Now Betseba dow aia tek kown nau mih pe tekah khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Nakhowk khe Adonija tek pe mih, “Sunem marowchak Abisag hown nape tachawng ang kownkow mang Sawlawmawn kowi tek pe dit. En laiklow dow aia nakuakta en kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Now Betseba klangah mih, “Iung chow. Nami lawnguan kowi mang kowi ang natek pe kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Naiawng rakowi Adonija kowh lawnguan mang Sawlawmawn kowi natek pe kownkow Betseba kowkowi khai bowt. Nakhowk khe mang Sawlawmawn mih awr rü hanow a-u kowi chupah khai, now aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm khai. Nakhowk khe mang mih a-u vüi cham paw pe chowm rah lowk hanow aia hawmlawm prakowi pe chowmah khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Nakhowk khe mang Sawlawmawn kowi a-u tek pe mih, “Ang lü en kown mih uowi pachap. Sakrauma hown hauang kuak ang lai diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Mang klangah mih, “Tek bowt au. En kowh laiklow ang kuak en dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Nakhowk khe Betseba tek pe mih, “En taimow Adonija hown Sunem marowchak Abisag iüah kowi pe tachawngah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Now tawmpa kunmarau hown a-u kowi mang Sawlawmawn klangah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Adonija vüi Abisag kowi chekhai en uang lü pe? Aia vüi pren paw uang lü snow! Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ang taimow chekhai. Nami klen kowi uamow Abiathar hai Zerui kowh chapa Joab paw aia pra tawi tangi mih en tuk khowk nadowi bow?” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG ming lüklaula se mang Sawlawmawn tek mih, “Naiawng uang lü ang mih rakowi Adonija kowh asak che ang pawta pe dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Apa David kowh mang chowm rah kowi pe chowm ang mih hai aia kowh laikham iawng ang vüi mang krungchak thawp ang mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang takham khowk, Adonija kowi mih ani nakowngta kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Nami kung kowi mang Sawlawmawn mih Adonija kowi nakowngta kownkow Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowi peah ana khai, now Benaia mih Adonija kowi saita khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abiathar kowh uamow rah pawta pe mih hai Joab kowi saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Nami kung kowi uamow Abiathar kowi mang tek pe mih, “Abiathar, en dow kowng tataing chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat ang kowngta en kown ang nau dowi tak. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow apa David sing uowi reng tak khe kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih chekhai, now apa kowh akrat pusara maten en tawi kham pe reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Anathawt kowi kowh en matia kowh krawng bawn kowi kowplan diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih CHAKRAMANG kowh uamow rah Abiathar hownia pawta pe khai. Naiawng hai Silo marow kowi kowh uamow Eli krungchak lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih dow uang tachi khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Nachowng mang kownkow Absalawm kowi tawi khowngah dowi chepaw Joab mih Adonija kowi dow tawi khowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Adonija kowi mang Sawlawmawn saita khai bowt pami satang tata hanow aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra kowi kowpowt hanow phuchuara nang kowi kowtadowk chen khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Now nami satang dow mang Sawlawmawn kowi maru uang tek pe khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowi mang peah ana mih, “Kowkowiah now Joab kowi kowsaita dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Naiawng rakowi Benaia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh tangbung lak kowi kowkupah now tek pe Joab mih, “Nauang lawt kownkow mang haw en khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Nachenganchepaw Joab klangah mih, “Ang uang lawt dowi tham. Mami re-e taih ang kowng kown,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Now Benaia dow aia kowi kowh Joab hawt tek pe mih laiklow mang kowi uang plan tek pe khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Nakhowk khe Benaia kowi mang peah ana mih, “Aia tek en iawng aia luk kowi kowchang diah. Aia kowi saita hanow dupah diah. Nahanow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi Joab saita mih aprek dow ang hai ang kimchakuüa luk kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Aia sai maru mih sung dow aia kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-pa David tuk dowi iawng aia dow angak uowi dowi mih maru pre ia kowi saita khai. Aia saiah mih maru pre ia dow Israel siphaiuüa kowh aluchow Ner kowh chapa Abner hai Juda siphaiuüa kowh aluchow Jether kowh chapa Amasa iüah chekhai. Kowiüah pre ia dow aia lak-e lang tachi tanawm hai maru lang iung chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Kowiüah kowi saita mih aprek dow Joab hai aia kowh krungchakuüa luk kowi chowngchowng saksakma pacham uowi reng lah. Nachenganchepaw David hai aia krungchakuüa, now aia kimchakuüa hai aia kowh mang chowm rah luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh thaulangra chowngchowng saksakma pacham uowi reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Nahanow Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia mih kowkowiah hanow Joab kowi kowsaita khai. Now Joab kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh aia kim re-e dupah khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Nami kung kowi dow Joab takcha kowi Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowi siphai aluchow rah mang mih peah khai, now uamow Abiathar takcha kowi dow Zadawk kowi mang mih peah uamow rah khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn saita Simei mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Nami kung kowi mang mih nakowhaw Simei kownkow kowchin maru khai. Now Simei uang ting khe mang hawt tek pe mih, “Jerusalem marow kowi kowthawp kim lowk hanow nakowi uowi diah. Akeng kowi mapaw en cham ia kowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />En che nami hownia lawt kowh Kidrawn lawngrawi klen kowi cham kowi khai hanow en cham kowi mih ni khe en nakowng ngengche kown pami tukah reng diah. En kowng mih aprek dow en matia luk kowi chowtaih nauang ting kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Nakhowk khe mang kowi Simei klangah mih, “Mangkri, en tek mih lainowmma iung. En tek iawng ang nachang en kown taih,” pape khai. Nami kung kowi dow Simei mih Jerusalem marow kowi akrama uowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Nachenganchepaw sum ning kung kowi dow Simei kowh nar pre ia mih Maka kowh chapa Akhis tut-e kowpowt khai. Akhis dow Gat marow mang chekhai. Now Gat marow kowi aia kowh nar pre ia uowi mih satang dow Simei kowi maru uang tek pe khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Nakhowk khe Simei mih aia kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau pe uan hanow aia kowh naruüa kowi krawi cham kownkow Gat marow mang Akhis tut-e kowkowi khai. Now nami hownia Simei mih aia kowh naruüa kowi uang plan pawla khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Now Jerusalem marow hownia Gat marow kowi kowkowi kowh Simei uang plan mih satang dow akung kowi mang Sawlawmawn kowi maru uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />Nakhowk khe Simei kowi hawah now mang tek pe mih, “Jerusalem marow hownia lawt kowh akeng kowi en cham kowi khai hanow en nakowng ngengche kown pami CHAKRAMANG ming hown takham khükhü ang tek en khowk nadowi bow? Nakhowk khe en tek ang mih, ‘Lainowmma iung, en tek iawng ang chang kown taih,’ pah nadowi bow? <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Naiawng now tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowh takhamta mih hai ang kowh ana pek en chün dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Nami klen kowi mang plan tek pe Simei mih, “Apa David luk kowi kowh en changta mih angak maten en tuk bowk chekhai. Kawmat dow en kowh lup ngak sung mih CHAKRAMANG nape en kown chowbowt. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Nachenganchepaw mang Sawlawmawn luk kowi dow prasira nauowi reng kown, now David kowh mang chowm rah dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi anikma nauowi reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih Simei kowi nasaita kownkow Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowi peah ana khai, now Benaia mih kowkowiah now Simei kowi kowsaita khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Naiawng hai Sawlawmawn kowh mangra dow awr khawt ngamlam khai.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn lü chanlaira mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Sawlawmawn dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh mang chama kowi pawah khai, now Aigupta pren mang hown chang auiua khai. Now mang Sawlawmawn mih aia kowh kim, CHAKRAMANG kowh kim hai Jerusalem marow tapat lut krawi ia chang tap dowi mowr amasi kowi David marow kowi towah khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Nami khin khe paw CHAKRAMANG kowh kim uowi dowi tak rakowi maru-uüa mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi tawncher hown chang phuchua pawi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Sawlawmawn dow CHAKRAMANG kowi sakrauah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow a-pa David kowh ana pek iawng chang reng chekhai. Tawkchedow aia paw arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi tawi chang phuchua khai, now nam iungma mih maikhük tawi towk khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Akat khe mang Sawlawmawn mih tawncher hown chang phuchua pawi kownkow Gibeawn marow kowi kowkowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khin khe kowh tawncher phuchuara kowi lang kri mih dow Gibeawn kowi kowh alowngma mih arah chekhai. Nakowi mang Sawlawmawn mih tawncher 1,000 pum hown tikah mih uanap chang khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Gibeawn marow kowi uowi khe uar-e mang lak kowi Sawlawmawn tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng khai. Sawlawmawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Lowra sia ang tut-e en awr lü mih ang nape en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn klangah mih, “En kowh nar David kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ahuma en tüng pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow en kaah sakowm iawng uowi en reng chekhai, now achi anawmma hai anowmma mih maru chekhai. Ani mih aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kownkow aia kowi dow en peah chapa lowk ia khai. Naiawng hown aia luk kowi dow achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, ang dow en kowh nar chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw apa takcha kowi kawmat mih en pe chowm ang mang khai. Nachenganchepaw ang dow ning diachow taih tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawng chow achang takla mih tawngpaw ang tuk dowi tak. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Makowi en kowh nar mih en kloah mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi khai. En kloah mih maru-uüa dow chenchap aiukma chekhai; amatni dow aiun nowng rüaah dowi mowr kawm khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh maru-uüa kowi nakruitownla kownkow hai aiung angak naia tukla kownkow en kowh nar kowi peah <char style="w">chanlaira</char> diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng khowt kawm mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi nowng kruitown mih dow miapaw uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Now chanlaira chowtaih Sawlawmawn awr lü mih kowi CHAKRAMANG dow hawt awmrawm pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Sawlawmawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Chowngdawng sakklangra, kowmatia vüi dawngthawnguan hai kowmatia ransu-uüa piakra en lü dowi kowi nachetla tara nowm kown mih vüi chanlaira chowtaih en lü khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />Naiawng rakowi en lüah mih sia ang nape en kown. Tukra hai chanlaira ang peta en khowk. Naiawng rakowi en dowi rawn paw en iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi tak, now en kung kowi paw en iawng mih miapaw nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Nami klen kowi en lüah dowi mih sia paw ang pela en khowk. Dawngthawnguan hai kri kraingra paw ang pela en khowk. Naiawng rakowi en chownglawng kowi kowh manguüa dow en hown tale mih miapaw nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />En pa David iawng en che ang kowh ari aiang hai rirow chün khai, now ang tiama kowi mang khai hanow chowngdawng sakklangra paw ang nape en kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawlawmawn mih awr rü müi khai, now nami dow uarmang kowi aia khi-ah mih taih padow tuk khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:15">Akung kowi Sawlawmawn mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowplan hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e kowiowng khai. Now tawncher hown tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap pawi aia kowchang khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh maru iukuüa maten vüi aia thak pawi khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanlaira hown Sawlawmawn chet tara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Akat khe chawkkrawma pre ia mih uangah hanow mang Sawlawmawn pur kowi uang iowng khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Now lowk ia mih tek pe mang mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, mami masiuüa angching dow pakimsang taiua uowi mih chekhai. Angching taiua uowi khe ang pen kachakuüa chah lowk ia. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Now ang chapa pen mih sum ni kung kowi aia paw pen kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Nami kim kowi dow angching klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />“Mami masiuüa dow uar-e amüi khe achah kowi nümta kowh kowngta khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Now uar-e ang müi thüm khe mami masiuüa mih ang kowh chapa kowi uang pawta khai, now aia kowh chapa uak mih ang ria kowi ta iüala hüah khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Now rau prakowi iawn nau kownkow ang awr rü mih khin khe ingcha akowngma mih ang tuk khai. Now uarthowi khe anowi kowi ang müah kaneu pache nami chah dow ang kowh nadowi pami ang tuk khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Nakhowk khe alowk mih masiuüa tek mih, “Ü, na kown chowbowt! Sing uowi mih taih ang kowh chah; kowng mih en kowh chah chowlowbow!” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Nachenganchepaw rik tek lai mih masiuüa atünma tek pe mih, “Na kown chowbowt, kowng mih taih en kowh chah; sing uowi mih ang kowh chah taih,” pakhai. Naiawng hai amatchi dow mang pur kowi taüa iüah khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Nakhowk khe mang tek mih, “Nami tek mih, ‘Sing uowi mih ang kowh chah taih, kowng mih paimi kowh chah chowlowbow,’ pakhai. Now paimi paw tek mih, ‘Na kown chowbowt. Kowng mih paimi kowh chah chowlowbow, ang kowh chah dow sing uowi mih taih,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Naiawng rakowi uang pawla ang saidawng lowk madiah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:24">Nahanow mang kowi uang pawla pe saidawng lowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Nakhowk khe mang pe ana mih, “Sing uowi mih chah kowi dungah pre dung diah. Now mami kowi dawnglang, paimi kowi dawnglang peah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Nakhowk khe sing uowi mih chah kowh u ching dow achah kowi lainowmma sanaah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe mang mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, sakrauma hown nami chah mih nami masiuüa kowi peta towbowt. Nami chah kowi hangkow saita diah,” pakhai. Tawkche alowk mih masiuüa tek mih, “Nami chah dow nami masiuüa paw hang paka lah; ang paw hang paka lah. Dungta bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Nakhowk khe mang tek mih, “Hangkow dungta diah! Sing uowi mih chah nami masiuüa kowi peah diah. Nami chah kowh u ching dow nami masiuüa chowtaih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Naiawng mang Sawlawmawn chet tara mih tata hanow Israeluüa maten mih mang kowi lainowmma ringkawah khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow nachetla tara nowm kown mih chanlaira Thurai peah pami tuk büah khai.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh maru iukuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow Israel pren paprenma kowi chowm mang khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Maiawngünuüa dow aia kowh lang pankri mih maru iukuüa chekhai. Zadawk kowh chapa Azaria dow uamow lang kri mih; <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Sisa kowh chapa Elihoref hai Ahija iüah dow mang kowh cha rui mih, Ahilud kowh chapa Jehosafat dow mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih, <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia dow siphai lang kri mih, now Zadawk hai Abiathar iüah dow uamow chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Nathan kowh chapa Azaria dow pren kruitown miuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih, now Nathan kowh chapa Zabud dow mang kowh prengia pek mih hai uamow chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahisar dow mang kowh kim mingkhet mih, now Abda kowh chapa Adoniram dow naruüa kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowh pren kruitown miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Israel pren paprenma kowi Sawlawmawn mih tow pe pren kruitown mih laipre ia khai. Naiawngün pren kruitown miuüa dow mang hai mang kimchakuüa vüi krawi kram pe chakkham reng chekhai. Amatni dow lowk ia e paning kowi pala vüi chi kram pe chakkham reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow Ben-Har, Ben-Har dow Efraim süng kowi kowh kruitown mih, <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />now Ben-Deker dow Makaz marow, Sa-Albim marow, Bet-Semes marow hai Elawnbet-Hanan marow kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Ben-Hesed dow Arubawt marow, Soko marow hai Hefer marow kowi kowh süng maten kowi kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Now Ben-Abinadab dow Nafawt-Dawr süng maten kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Aia kowh masi dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh chama Tafat chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Ahilud kowh chapa Bana dow Tanak marow hai Megido marow kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Zarethan re-e kowh Bet-San süng maten paw kruitownla khai. Aia dow Jezerel mrawkphak pra kowh Bet-San marow hownia Abel-Mehola iawng panow Jawkmeam mowr paw krawi kruitownla khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Ben-Geber dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow kowi kruitown mih chekhai. Aia dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Manase chapa Jair kua hai Basan kowi kowh Argawb süng maten kruitownla khai. Argawp süng dow tap tapat lut chekhai, now nami süng kowi dow kua uowi 60 kua chekhai; naiawngün kua maten dow aiukma kangowh panow kri hown aklia uowi mih tap uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ido kowh chapa Ahinadab dow Mahanaim marow kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaz dow Naptali süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Aia kowh masi dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh chama Basemat chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Husai kowh chapa Bana dow Aseruüa kowh süng hai Bealawt marow kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Now Parua kowh chapa Jehosafat dow Isakaruüa kowh süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Ela kowh chapa Simei dow Benjamin süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Now Uri kowh chapa Geber dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun hai Basan pren mang Awk kowh süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh dawngthawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Juda hai Israel pren kowi kowh maru iun kawm krang dow sata pang kowi kowh sema iawng chekhai. Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe dow amatni kowh chakkham alawkma chekhai, now apiaw apama uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Nami khin khe mang Sawlawmawn kruitownah mih süng dow Iufratis aw hownia uownah kowh Aigupta pren sünghi iawng panow Filistinuüa kowh pren sünghi mowr chekhai. Nami lak kowi kowh tawi taphang mih pren maten dow nami khin khe mang Sawlawmawn nimkrüa kowi uowi khai, now mang Sawlawmawn sing uowi mowr dow aia kowi peah <char style="w">mangmu</char> büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Ni towng mang Sawlawmawn chaah mih chakkham dow maiawng: Kawmdi aiungma mih 5,000 set ngia, iawngpa mih kawmdi 10,000 set ngia, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />Chahau hown kowh thumah mih chia hamüt pum, dowm kowi kowh thingah mih chia 20 pum hai ruapur 100 pum chekhai. Nami klen kowi naki, ngaia, ngahiu, ua hai umpai ün paw uowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Sawlawmawn mih Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren Tifsa hownia Gaza marow mowr krawi kruitownla khai. Aia kruitownah mih pren maten dow thaulangma chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Sawlawmawn chowng khe dow Juda hai Israel pren kowi kowh uowi mih maten thaulangma uowi khai; Dan marow hownia Ber-Seba marow mowr kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowh dow grep krum hai uidut khang uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Sawlawmawn kowh kawrnga kari küng mih kawrnga maten vüi kim uowi 40,000 chekhai, now siphaiuüa chowmah mih kawrnga uowi 12,000 chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Pren kruitown miuüa dow amatni takhowmta iawng la towng mang Sawlawmawn hai aia kowh pawitang kowi tawi cha tawi kham miuüa vüi krawi kram pe chakkham reng chekhai. Amatni dow tawngpaw akhawr nauowila dowi kownkow pela ching reng khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Amatni dow kawrnga kari küng mih kawrnga hawmh vüi hai akeng mih kawrnga hawmh vüi paw chowlowkkow chak rah re-e uang tow pe iakmow hai chahau reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh chanlaira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowi dow prengia, chanlaira hai tukra mih sata kowi kowh sema iawng ahuma Thurai peah khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Satlawt pra kowh pren hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh chanlaima mih maru-uüa maten lak-e Sawlawmawn kowh dow chanlaira lang hu chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Aia dow maru maten lak-e lang chanlai chekhai. Aia dow Ezrahit kowi kowh Ethan, Heman, Kalko hai Mahawl kowh chapa Darda lak-e paw lang chanlai chekhai. Aia kowh ming iung nang iung dow aria aret kowi kowh chenchapuüa maten tut-e krawi tauet khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Aia dow chanlai lawng tekla 3,000 chap chekhai, now meng paw thawnla 1,005 klüng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Aia dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh hownia uownah now tap kowi kowh awm mih lawngthow pawi mowr singh uowi mih maten lawnguan kowi tekla khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow asadua, uakling uaber, kam hai sowr mih kaurawng uaramchak hai sawng dam lawnguan kowi paw tekla khai. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Now palusama hownia kowh manguüa mih mang Sawlawmawn kowh chanlaira lawnguan kowi tawi ta miuüa dow Sawlawmawn kowh chanlaira atekma mih laiklow nape süntaah kownkow uang chin maru reng chekhai. Naiawng hai chenchap maten mih mang Sawlawmawn tut-e uang reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih kamrüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Tura marow mang Hiram dow David hown auiua sinma chekhai. Aia dow David kowh chapa Sawlawmawn ta chowm mang mih satang tawi tata hanow aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi Sawlawmawn tut-e kowchinah khai. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Now naiawngün maru iukuüa kowi Sawlawmawn krawi plan tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Apa David kowi dow ariaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa uang kingküaah hanow uang senah rengreng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi nowngta bowk dowi mowr CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai vüi ia thawp Thurai chup kim dowi chekhai. Nami lawnguan kowi en paw tuk bowk towbowt. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai mih pren maten hownia pe ang thaulangra khai bowt. Kawmat dow tawng iawng mih ransu paw ang kowh uowi dowi, now tawng iawng mih phih paw uang ting dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai kowi nachupiiala kownkow ang nathawp pe chup kim lowk kown ang nau. Tawngplawng kowchow panow apa David kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, ‘En kowh mang chowm rah kowi en kowh chapa kowi ang nape chowmah kown. Aia dow nachupiiala ang kownkow ang vüi nathawp ang chup kim kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />“Naiawng rakowi Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh ang vüi nakowtu ang kownkow en kowh maru-uüa kowi peah ana diah. En kowh maru-uüa hown ang kowh maru-uüa paw natawi uowi ngengche kown taih, now sukkri kha mih en khowmta bowkta iawng en kowh maru-uüa kowi ang napeah kown taih. Sing tuk prakowi dow Sidawnuüa iawng akiakma mih anging pungmadawng kowi miapaw uowi dowi mih en aiawng tuk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Nami satang tata hanow mang Hiram dow lainowmma awmrawm khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek mih, “Ani mih CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng kri kraingma mih chenchapuüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow aia dow mang David kowi chapa chanlaima mih peah lowk ia khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Now Hiram uang chin pe maru now Sawlawmawn kowi tek pe mih, “En uang krawi phowng ang mih satang ang ta khowk, now en krawi tek ang iawng ang nachang en kown taih. Sidar singh hai karpowng singh dow ang nauang krawi sa en kown taih. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Naiawngün singh dow ang kowh maru-uüa mih Lebanawn hungh hownia Mediteranean sata mowr naiu klala kown. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün singh mih pan iawng nathawpah büah hanow en tekah mih arah kowi nauang pawla en kown towbowt. Now ang kim kowi kowh maru-uüa vüi chakkham tarapdow en krawi kram ang panü ang nau chowdiah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Naiawng hai Hiram mih Sawlawmawn nau iawng sidar singh hai karpowng singh maten krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Now Sawlawmawn paw Hiram kim kowi kowh maru-uüa vüi krawi kram pe chakkham reng chekhai. Aia dow Hiram kowh maru-uüa chak müa paning kowi püm 50,000 mawn, now kanrawn sau achangma mih 4,800 set chi krawi sa pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Now CHAKRAMANG mih aia takhamta iawng Sawlawmawn kowi peah chanlaira khai. Hiram hai Sawlawmawn iüah dow thaulangma uowi khai, now amatchi dow tatow sangbowk laitawm khai.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih Israel pren paprenma hownia maru iun 30,000 ia kowi kür hown pe changah nar lup khai. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi mang mih pala kowi 10,000 ia chi Lebanawn hungh kowi kowchinah khai. Amatni dow pala chi Lebanawn hungh kowi uowi khai, now pre la dow kowmatia kim kowi uowi büah khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh lup chang namü kown mih kurdik dow Adoniram luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Mang Sawlawmawn nimkrüa kowi kowh kurdik lup chang mih maru iun dow 70,000 ia chekhai, now hungh kowi kowh hua bawp mih maru iun dow 80,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />Naiawngün lup chang miuüa kowi kowh mingkhet mih dow maru iun 3,300 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Amatni dow mang ana pek iawng Thurai chup kim vüi nachangla kimchüng kownkow aiuk aiukma panow asung khakma mih hua chaing cham krawi bawp hanow uang pawla büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Now nachangla Thurai chup kim kownkow naiawngün hua dow Sawlawmawn hai Hiram kowh laksmauüa hai Gebal marowchakuüa hown klangiungma bawpah khai, now singh ün paw klangiungma kamrütah büah khai.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn thawp Thurai chup kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt mih kung kowi 480 ning khe Sawlawmawn mih uown thawp CHAKRAMANG chup kim khai. Nami dow Israeluüa luk kowi aia chowm mang mih tali ning nga kowi kowh pre la khe chekhai. Nami dow Ziv la chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Mang Sawlawmawn changah mih CHAKRAMANG chup kim dow areng aklang 60 muk, adowng phia 20 muk, now akro 30 muk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak lang iuk mih pur kowi kowh kimpuk dow kim downg phia hown katsang chekhai, now areng klang dow hamüt muk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Now nami Thurai chup kim kowi dow aia thawpla pe tawngpawk hanow tow pe lawngha lawkrachow khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Now Thurai chup kim uat prakowi areng pre pra trui hai akhung pra kowh bang chawnah hanow thawp pe sum krowng kim lowk khai. Nami sum krowng kim kowi dow towklak huma aia thawp pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Adak krowng kowi kowh towklak iuk dow tanga muk chi, pre krowng kowi kowh towklak iuk dow taruk muk chi, now sum krowng kowi kowh towklak iuk dow ranit muk chi chekhai. Now nami kimkrowng vüi kowi kowh klowng maten Thurai chup kim lak pra akrua naklala dowi kownkow prang hownia abang kowi thawp pe klowng tang müa khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Thurai chup kim chang müa kowi kowh tawngah mih hua maten dow cham huila prowng kowh uang pawla mih hua kangowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi thawp Thurai chup kim mih khin khe matul, marek hai tawng iawng mih lawngha rutchün khawkleng tünteu taah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Adak krowng kowi kupla kown mih aplawt dow Thurai chup kim mrawkphak prakowi chekhai. Nami hownia pre krowng hai sum krowng kowi awr pünla kown mih dow thawp pe dawngbowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Naiawng hai aia dow Thurai chup kim mih thawpah khai, now chur paw aia ia churta khai. Kimluk dow sidar singh phen hown klowng luk kowi aia iu lukah khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Nami sum krowng kim kowi mih towklak ahuma aia thawpla khai. Naiawngün towklak dow akro tanga muk chi chekhai, now akrowng towng kowi sidar singh hown kowh klowng dow Thurai chup kim akhung pra kowh bang hown tachawn khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Sawlawmawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“En che ang kowh alow pek iawng mang khai, ang kowh rirow maten chün hai ang kowh ana pek maten chün khai hanow en thawpah mih CHAKRAMANG chup kim lawnguan kowi en pa David tut-e kowh ang takhamta iawng ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Now Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang natawi uowi kown, now ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi katpaw ang napowtta kown nadowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Sawlawmawn mih CHAKRAMANG chup kim uown chang hanow naiawng hai churta khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Aia dow kimphai hownia kimluk mowr kim lak pra kowh kimbang maten kowi sidar singh hown kowh phen hown krawi pingah khai, now kimphai maten kowi dow karpowng singh hown kowh phen hown aia krawi phaiah khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Now nami Thurai chup kim lak kowi dow Lang Chimsai mih towklak paw aia thawpla pe lowk khai. Nami towklak dow Thurai chup kim akhung pra kowh downg kowi chekhai. Nami towklak dow areng klang pirmi muk chekhai, now kimphai hownia kimluk mowr mih sidar singh hown kowh phen hown krawi pingah khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Lang Chimsai mih towklak pur kowi kowh chimsaima mih towklak dow areng klang 40 muk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Thurai chup kim alak pra kowh kimbang dow nakhila hua dowi kownkow dan pe sidar singh phen khai. Now nami phen maten kowi dow uih rup hai pau rup her pe khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Naiawng hai natowla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kownkow Lang Chimsai mih arah dow Thurai chup kim akhung kowi Sawlawmawn thawpah khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Nami arah dow areng klang 20 muk, adowng phia 20 muk hai akro 20 muk chekhai. Nami towklak alak dow achangma mih kuh hown sowah khai, now phuchuara dow sidar singh phen hown pingah hanow kuh hown aia sowah khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimbang maten dow kuh achangma mih hown aia sowah khai, now Lang Chimsai mih towklak pur kowi dow kuh hown kowh leng chawp pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Aia dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh alak maten kuh hown sowah khai. Lang Chimsai mih Arah kowi kowh phuchuara paw kuh hown aia sowah khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23-26" />Lang Chimsai mih Arah kowi natowah kownkow kanrawn singh hown aia thawp pe <char style="w">Cherup</char> rup pachum khai. Nami Cherup rup pre buk mih dow aiuk hai apowm katsang aia thawpah khai. Now Cherup rup pre buk mih akro dow hamüt muk chi aia thawpah khai. Nami Cherup rup kowh alap klang dow tanga muk chi chekhai. Nami Cherup rup kowh alap dow mami kowh lap tut hownia paimi kowh lap tut mowr kowi hamüt muk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:23-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Nami Cherup rup pre buk mih dow alap iangma kangowh Lang Chimsai mih Arah kowi aia towah khai. Cherup rup lowk mih kowh alap papra dow mapra kowh kimbang kowi takak khai, now alowk mih kowh alap paw papra mih dow alowk mih pra kowh kimbang kowi takak chekhai. Now akeng pra kowh lap dow lowkkowlowk alap chem takak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Now nami Cherup rup pre buk trui dow kuh hown aia sowah khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak pre buk mih aping maten kowi dow Cherup rup ün, chekmarawng singh rup ün hai pau rup ün aia her pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Now nami towklak pre buk trui kowh aphai paw kuh hown aia sawnah khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Lang Chimsai mih towklak plawt dow kanrawn singh phen hown aia thawpah khai. Nami towklak plawt mawm kowh dow anui uowi tanga klüng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Nami towklak büng dow pre pra trui kowi Cherup rup ün, chekmarawng singh ün hai pau rup ün aia her pe khai, now nami towklak büng kowi dow aia sow pe kuh khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33-34" />Thurai chup kim vüi kowi dow kanrawn singh hown tali nui mih kimplawt mawm aia thawpah khai, now kimbüng dow karpowng singh phen hown pre phia chi aia thawpah pre buk khai. Nami kimbüng pre buk mih dow naia klepah kownkow pre phia chi mih kowi chawp pe akli khai. <verse eid="1KI 6:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Nami kimbüng kowi paw Cherup rup ün, chekmarawng singh hai pau rup ün aia her pe hanow kuh hown sowah khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Thurai kim lak kowi kowh viadawng dow klangiungchow bawpah mih hua sum tan hai sidar singh phen atatma mih hown aia pingah khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Thurai chup kim vüi uown phük kimchüng mih dow Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih tali ning kowi kowh Ziv la khe chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Now khowmta bowkta mih powm iawng aia dow lailowk ning nga kowi kowh Bul la kowi Thurai chup kim chang lup maten churta khai. Nami Thurai chup kim thawp dow Sawlawmawn mih ranit ning lakke khai.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn thawp aia kowh kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih aiamat vüi thawp chawkku kim sangrum khai. Naiawngün kim aia chang mih dow laisum ning lakke khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2-3" />Naiawngün chawkku kim pungmadawng kowi aia dow Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim pami kim thawpla lowk khai. Nami Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim dow aklang 100 muk, aphia 50 muk, now akro 30 muk aia thawpah khai. Nami kim vüi dow sidar singh hown kowh kimchüng aia phük pe sum tan khai. Naiawngün kimchüng dow bowkbowk kowi 45 klüng chekhai, now naiawngün kimchüng luk kowi dow aia tang pe klowng khai. Naiawngün klowng luk kowi dow sidar sing phen hown aia lukah khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Now nami kim kowi kowh kimbang kowi dow mapra reng hown paipra reng tatingtang klowk chi aia thawp pe tawngpawk sum tan khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Now <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Now </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi paw alang alangma arui uowi chekhai.</char></note>kimbüng hai kimplawt mawm maten dow tali tingnui chi aia thawpah khai. Now tawngpawk maten dow sum tan trui tatingtang klowk chi aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Nami klen kowi Achüng pami kim paw aia thawpla lowk khai. Nami kim dow areng klang 50 muk, now adowng phia 30 muk chekhai. Nami kim downg kowi dow aia towla pe kimpuk khai, now nami kimpuk dow kimchüng luk kowi khia pe klowng hanow aia lukah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Nami klen kowi Tara chetra Towk paw aia thawpla lowk khai. Nami towklak kowi dow aia kowh mang chowm rah uowi chekhai. Nami towk dow nachetla tara kownkow aia thawpah mih chekhai. Nami towk dow aphai hownia aluk mowr sidar singh phen hown aia krawi pingta bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Nami Tara chetra Towk khung pra dow viadawng uowi lowk chekhai. Aiamat uowi rah kim dow nami viadawng ria kowi aia thawpah khai. Nami kim dow akeng mih kim powm iawng aia thawpah khai. Nami klen kowi aia kowh masi <char style="w">Faraw</char> kowh chama vüi paw akeng mih kim powm iawng aia thawpla lowk khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh kim dow viadawng hailawm <char style="w">achüng</char> hownia aluk mowr mih arisang ngenah mih asung khakma kangowh mih hua hown thawpah mih chekhai. Naiawngün hua maten dow sawksak hown arisang ngenah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Nami kim kowi kowh achüng maten dow asung khakma mih hua aiuk aiukma mih kangowh hown thawpah mih chekhai. Naiawngün hua mih tawngbak mih dow aiuk hamüt muk chi, now tawngbak mih dow aiuk raiat muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Now achüng kowi kowh hua luk kowi paw arisang ngenah mih hua asung khakma kangowh mih hai sidar singh phen tow pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Mang kim re-e kowh viadawng lang iuk mih ping tapat lut mih kowi dow klangiungma ngenah mih hua atanma krowngah mih sum krowng luk kowi lowk chi tang pe sidar singh hown kowh klowng khai. Nami viadawng ping dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh viadawng hai kimpuk kowi kowh viadawng iawng thawpah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kri hown kowh kimchüng pre buk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13-14" />Tura marow kowi Hiram pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia dow kri hown achap kawm lup tuk chang chekhai. Aia kowh pa dow kowng khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh u dow sing reng tak chekhai. Aia kowh u dow Naptali krungchak masiuüa chekhai. Now Thurai chup kim kowi natawngah kown mih uanh kri hown nauang thawp kownkow akat khe Hiram kowi mang Sawlawmawn hawah khai. Naiawng rakowi Hiram dow Tura marow hownia Jerusalem kowi uang khai, now aia kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn pe changah mih lup maten uang chang khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 7:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Jerusalem marow kowi uangah now Hiram mih kri hown thawp kimchüng pre buk khai. Nami kimchüng pre buk trui dow aklang lairiat muk chi, now aiuk sum lam chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Now nami kimchüng luk kowi nachowmah kown mih kri hown aia thawp pe alu pre buk khai. Nami alu pre buk mih dow akro tanga muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17-18" />Now<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17-18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Now </char><char style="ft" closed="false">17-20 uan kowi kowh laiklow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi alang alangma ruiah khai.</char></note> nami kimchüng lu pre buk vüi klangiungma aia ker pe kri leng ranit klüng chi khai, now kri hown thawp pe <char style="w">dalim</char> uih pre tan chi khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Nami kimpuk kowi kowh kimchüng lu pre buk mih aluk pra tali muk chi dow lili pau powm iawng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Now nami alu dak pra dow alumpuma kangowh chekhai. Nami alumpuma mih kowi dow tapat lut kri leng krawi umh pe khai. Nami alu pre buk trui kowi kowh kri leng tapat lut mih kowi dow atanma krawi tan pe kri hown kowh dalim uih rup 200 khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Now nami kimchüng pre buk mih dow Thurai chup kim kimpuk re-e Hiram chowkah khai. Mrawkphak pra kowh aia chowkah mih kimchüng ming dow Jachin pahai aia chap pe khai, now tawngphak pra aia chowkah mih kimchüng ming dow Boaz pahai aia chap pe khai. (Jachin pami auan dow “Achowk miia” pami chekhai, now Boaz pami auan dow “Aia tut-e kür uowi” pami chekhai). <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Lili pau powm iawng kri hown thawpah mih alu pre buk dow kimchüng pre buk mih luk kowi chowmah khai. Naiawng hai kimchüng pre buk dow aia ki thawpta khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kri hown kowh tuipam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Nami kung kowi dow natowla tui kownkow Hiram mih klai pe kri mih tuipam aiukma thawp lowk khai. Nami tuipam dow mami uer hownia atengma paimi uer mowr khaiah hanow hamüt muk chekhai. Abüp dow tanga muk, now aiuk dow 30 muk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Nami tuipam uat pra dow auer dakchow kowi tapat lut kri hown kowh thawpah mih uih rup uowi pre tan chekhai. Naiawngün uih rup dow pamuk e taruk klüng ngia chi thawpah khai. Naiawngün uih rup dow klaiah khe hownia aiawng uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Now nami tuipam dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih chiala laipre pum mih luk kowi chowmah khai. Naiawngün chiala dow tawngphak pra dang sum pum, satkup pra dang sum pum, mrawkphak pra dang sum pum, now satlawt pra dang sum pum chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Nami tuipam tat dow tali met chekhai. Nami tuipam mowr dow bia chah mowr iawng chekhai, now lili pau powm iawng uat prakowi awr talown khai. Nami tuipam kowi tui takowi mih dow 44,000 set chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kri hown kowh tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Nami klen kowi paw Hiram mih kri hown thawp tawkpla hamüt klüng khai. Naiawngün tawkpla dow areng klang tali muk chi, adowng phia tali muk chi, now akro sum muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Nami tawkpla dow tavir lut akuang akuangchow thawpah hanow kri apherklepchow mih hown akuang towng krawi pingah khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Nami pingla tawkpla mih kripa luk kowi dow herah mih krangsi rup, chia rup hai Cherup rup uowi chekhai, now krangsi rup hai chia rup luk kowi hai adak kowi dow her pe pau rup khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Naiawngün tawkpla maten kowi dow alün müa kri khawk tali klüng chi thawp pe khai. Now aluk pra dow biatum chowm müa lawngken kowi anui tali klüng hownia chawp pe athawk khai. Naiawngün athawk maten kowi dow tali dam trui kowi her pe pau rup bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Naiawngün biatum chowm müa lawngken dow adawnglang kowi akuangma kangowh chekhai. Nami akuang uar dow mami ret hownia paimi ret mowr kowi amuk hown dawnglang chi chekhai. Nami lawngken uer dow tapat lut sawt pe bawng khai. Naiawngün lawngken kro dow tawkpla luk kowi pamuk chi chekhai. Naiawngün tawkpla dow alumpuma nadowi kowi tali tingnui chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Naiawngün tawkpla kowi adak pra dow alün müa khawk uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. Naiawngün khawk kowi kowh ahawng dow klai tawkpla khe klaila mih chekhai. Naiawngün khawk maten dow aiuk amuk hown dawnglang chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Naiawngün khawk dow kawrnga kari khawk iawng kangowh chekhai. Naiawngün akhawk kowi kowh uowi mih uanh maten dow kri hown kowh sowah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Tawkpla maten kowi dow tali tingnui kowi athawk uowi tali klüng chi chekhai. Naiawngün athawk paw klai tawkpla khe kowh klaila mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Now tawkpla luk maten kowi dow aluk prakowi akro pakar chi mih kri hown kowh thawpah mih lawngkua uowi lowk chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Naiawngün lawngkua thawk maten kowi dow uat prakowi Cherup rup, krangsi rup hai chekmarawng singh rup her pe khai. Naiawngün dow tawkpla akuangma mih kowi kowh pingla mih kripa kowi iawng her pe arup khai. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Naiawng hai Hiram mih tawkpla hamüt klüng thawpah khai. Naiawngün tawkpla maten dow aiuk hai apowm katsang aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Now naiawngün tawkpla maten vüi dow kri hown aia thawp pe biatum hamüt klüng khai. Nami tuipam dow mami uer hownia atengma paimi uer mowr khaiah hanow tali muk chekhai, now biatum lowk kowi tui takowi mih dow 880 set chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Now tawkpla hamüt klüng mih dow Thurai chup kim mrawkphak prakowi tanga klüng, tawngphak prakowi tanga klüng aia towah khai. Now mrawkphak hai satlawt pra kowh nui kowi dow tuipam aiukma mih aia towah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi tawngah kown mih uanh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Nami klen kowi paw maivia towk rah puh ün, uaibak ün hai bia ün aia thawpla khai. Naiawng hai Hiram mih mang Sawlawmawn vüi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup maten uownah mih dow churta khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Hiram thawpah mih uanh dow kimchüng pre buk, kimchüng luk kowi kowh chowmah mih alumpuma mih alu pre buk, alu pre buk mih kowi kowh umah mih kri leng pre rüa, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />naiawngün kri leng kowi natanah pre tan kown mih dalim uih 400 klüng, <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />tawkpla hamüt klüng, tawkpla luk kowi kowh chowmah kown mih biatum hamüt klüng, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />tuipam aiukma mih lowk, tuipam aiukma mih chowm müa kri hown kowh chiala laipre pum, <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />plawi kuak müa puh, plawi vür müa uaibak hai tui thet müa bia chah ün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Thurai chup kim vüi kowi kowh Hiram thawpah mih uanh maten dow sowah mih kri hown kowh kangowh chekhai. Naiawngün uanh maten dow mang Sawlawmawn ana pek iawng Hiram thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Naiawngün uanh maten dow Jawrdan lawngrawi re-e kowh Sukawt hai Jerethan marow takra kowi bawnnai kowi klai pe kri kowh mang Sawlawmawn pe thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Naiawngün uanh dow hu lai bowt kowh mang Sawlawmawn khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün kri uanh dow mün khowt chow adik uowi mih tukah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Thurai chup kim vüi kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih uanh dow kuh hown kowh phuchuara, chimsaima mih kawm towk rah kuh hown kowh pawitang, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />kuh achangma mih hown kowh thawpah mih <char style="w">maibu towngh</char> ün chekhai. Naiawngün maibu towngh dow lang chimsai mih arah pur kowi hawmlawm pra tanga klüng, now lakuai pra tanga klüng aia towah khai. Nami klen kowi kuh hown kowh thawpah mih pau, bia hai kep, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />kuh achangma mih hown kowh thawpah mih bia chah, bawthi kep müa kaingkep, nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa biatum, uaibak hai mairing towk müa puh ün aia thawpah khai. Nami klen kowi Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak lang iuk mih kimplawt klia müa kuh hown kowh akli ün thawpah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup maten ki changta khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih CHAKRAMANG vüi a-pa David lang kraah mih uanh maten Thurai chup kim kowi uang pawla khai. Naiawngün a-pa David lang kraah mih uanh dow kuh, tai hai achap kawm uanh chekhai. Naiawngün uanh maten dow aia mih Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh ki thawpta bowk kung kowi dow Mang Sawlawmawn mih David marow (Zaiawn) kowi kowh towah mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla Thurai chup kim kowi nauang pawla kownkow kamrüt khai. Aia dow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa hai Israel krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa dow nasun <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> kownkow nakowi uowi khai. Nami akhin dow Ethanim pami la ranit la khe chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3-4" />Now aluchowuüa maten uang taküm kung kowi dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla, taklowp taklangra te hai chimsaima mih uanh maten Thurai chup kim kowi kowpawla khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 8:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Now mang Sawlawmawn hai aia hown kowh tawi mih maru kawmuüa maten dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi chia hai ruapur ahuma phuchua khai. Amatni changla phuchua mih chia hai ruapur dow hu lai kowh nowng rüaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Nami kung kowi dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak kowi uamowuüa uang pawla khai, now nami dow Cherup rup kowh lap krüa kowi towah büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Nahanow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai akawtlawng maten dow Cherup rup kowh lap hown tatung bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Naiawngün akawtlawng dow klang lai rakowi naiawngün chem dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih towklak hownia ia khi khai. Nachenganchepaw chimsaima mih towklak uat hownia dow ia khi dowi chekhai. (Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow akawtlawng hailawm kawmat pat nami Thurai chup kim lak kowi uowi reng chekhai). <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi dow Mosi towah mih sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm huapher dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt kung kowi Sinai hungh re-e uowi khe amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Now chimsaima mih towklak hownia uamowuüa uang lawt kung kowi dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi mih uangnim atekma uang uowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Now naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi uangnim iawng atekma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa mih tawng lup paw nowng chang dowi bowt.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ‘Uangnim atatma mih kowi ang uowi kown,’ padow en tek khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Kawmat dow en vüi kim klangiungma ang thawpta en lowk khowk. Mami kim dow chowngchowng saksakma en vüi uowi rah naown bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Naiawng ki tek kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih aia ria kowi kowh iowng rimrim mih maru kawmuüa prakowi haitaplan hanow peah prasi khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow apa David tut-e kowh aiamat nawr hown takhamta mih uang pe tachiah khai bowt. Aia dow tek mih, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla kung kowi nachupiiala ang kownkow ang kowh chup kim thawp rah Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia mia iawng mih krungchakuüa kowh marow paw ang ruiah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi nakruitownah kownkow David kowi ang kloah khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />“CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi nathawp pe chup kim lowk kownkow apa David kowh sak kowi uowi chowdiah. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Nachenganchepaw apa David kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, ‘Ang vüi nathawp ang chup kim lowk kown en sak kowi uowi mih iung. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Tawkchedow ang vüi chup kim mih en nathawp kown nadowi; en matia kowh chapa chowtaih nathawp kown. Ang vüi chup kim dow aia chowtaih nathawp kown,’ pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh laikham uang pe tachiah khai bowt. Aia dow apa kowh mang rah pe ang khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham iawng Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi dow ang chowm khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi mami chup kim dow ang thawp pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Now nami chup kim kowi dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towk rah ang thawp pe khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow uowi mih huapher uowi chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm dow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla kung kowi a-i kowh pipu-uüa hown aia tatowah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ap Thurai chup kim khe kowh chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih nakowi kowh takua talawm mih Israeluüa pur kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara re-e iowng pah mukuang prakowi chawkla rut se chup Thurai khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, krawng hai mukuang kowi en iawng mih Thurai miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. En dow en kowh sangbowk laitawm en townah reng chekhai. En dow plawng hown sak hown en tiama kowi mang mih en kowh naruüa luk kowi en kowh sakraura achur uowi dowi mih en tüng pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />En kowh nar apa David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih en uang pe tachiah khai. En dow nawr hown kowh en tekta mih iawng en chang mih ani anging khi khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />“Kawmat mih aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, apa David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih townah reng diah. Apa David kowi en khamah mih, ‘En kowh chapauüa che en iawng ang kowh ari aiang kowi uowi iawng mang hai pe ching khai hanow Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kown mih en krungchak hownia maru nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Aw Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en kowh nar apa David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih pauang tachi lah.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Nachenganchepaw aw Thurai, lusa kowi en nauowi nowm kown bow? Kuang dawng hai <char style="w">mukuang pren</char> kowi khowm padow en uowi rah takowi dowi mih tawng iawng chow ang thawp en mih mami kim kowi en natakowi kown chow? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, ani kowh en kowh nar awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta pe diah. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Mami en kowh chup kim prakowi ni chut uar prowt chi uang iu müah reng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami arah dow nachupiiala en kownkow en lang kloah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mami en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se ang uang lü mih khin khe hawt sünta ang diah. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Mami arah prakowi dang se en kowh nar hai en kowh maru Israeluüa uang lü uang leng mih khin khe hawt sünta anging diah. Naiawng uang lü uang leng mih dow en uowi rah mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta anging diah, now anging kowh angak dow lawtta anging diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Aprek uowi dowi mih maru luk kowi maru tang pe aprek mih khin uowi chepaw naia. Nami khin khe nami maru mih aia kowh aprek uowi dowi mih sawi natakham kownkow mami en kowh chup kim re-e phuchuara ria kowi uang chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />Nakhowk khe en mih mukuang pren hownia nami maru kowh laiklow hawt sünta pe diah, now chet pe tara nowm diah. Chang ngak mih maru kowi dow aia kowh angak sung peah ripra diah, now chang angak dowi mih maru kowi dow aia kowh angak uowi dowi mih phuang pe diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“En kowi kingküala mih angak changta rakowi en kowh maru Israeluüa mih ransu-uüa tut-e tasen sum khe amatni che en tut-e uang plan hai mami en kowh chup kim kowi rowsi en hai en tut-e uang lü uang leng khai hanow <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />nakhowk khe amatni awr lü awr leng mih mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah, now en kowh maru Israeluüa kowi amatni kowh angak lawtta pe hanow amatni pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren kowi uang plan pawla iawk diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“En kowh maru-uüa mih en kowi kingküala mih angak changta rakowi mukuang hownia en peah uang dowi mih khin khe amatni che mami en kowh chup kim prakowi uang dang khai, rowsi en khai, en tut-e awr lü awr leng khai, now en hownia ka ripra kowh angak hownia uang plan büah khai hanow <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />amatni awr lü awr leng mih mukuang pren hownia en hawt sünta pe diah, now en kowh nar Israeluüa kowh angak lawtta pe diah. Amatni kowi dow chownglawng kowi anowmma naia mangla kownkow tüngsangah diah, now nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow amatni kowi en peah mih pren luk kowi uang uang pe uangah diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Pren kowi che <char style="w">khown</char> hai kowng hawi uang kla khai, luprak keula mih rawka phaw khai, luprak kowi plawng hai tuiselengkeng nammow hawmh krawi cha khai, amatni kowh tawngbak mih marow kowi chünchü ransu-uüa uang rumah khai, lowra mih phih hai rawka uang ting khai chepaw <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />en kowh maru Israeluüa mih nami khin khe tarip kowh sak kowi rauma hown mami en kowh chup kim prakowi chawk rut se awr lü awr leng khai hanow <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />nami dow en kowh uowi rah mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah. Amatni kowi dow en mih lawtta diah. Amatni kowi dow amatni changah mih lup iawng chet pe tara diah. (Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru maten kowh sak kowi tawng chow uowi mih tuk mih dow en chowtaih chekhai). <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Nahanow anging pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren kowi chownglawng prat en kowh maru-uüa nakram en kown towbowt.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41-42" />“Nami klen kowi prenlang maru-uüa paw en kowh ming kri kraingma mih hai en kowh akürma mih rut hown en kowh ransu-uüa kowi en ripah mih laiklow tawi ta chepaw naia. Nahanow nachupiia en kownkow pren lakma hownia uangah now mami en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se naawr lü naawr leng chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />Nakhowk khe en kowh uowi rah mukuang pren hownia en mih hawt sünta pe diah. Lusa kowi kowh maru maten naia tukla en kownkow, en kowh maru Israeluüa iawng amatni paw ringkawma hown nakram en kownkow hai ang thawpah mih mami kim dow en kowh kim chekhai pami naia tukla kownkow amatni awr lü mih iawng chang pe diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Ransu-uüa hown nacham tasen kownkow en maru-uüa kowi en cham chinah mih khin uowi chepaw naia. Nakhowk khe amatni cham uowi rah hownia en lang kloah mih marow prakowi hai en vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se awr lü awr leng büah chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />Nakhowk khe amatni awr lü awr leng mih dow mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah, now amatni kowi tawi tangila diah.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Chang angak dowi mih maru dow miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh maru-uüa changta angak mih khin khe amatni luk kowi en sak-ih dowi kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi en nacham ap-ah chepaw naia, now amatni kowi dow atawnchow rah kowi lah, alakma rah kowi lah nachangla nar kownkow ransu-uüa nacham pawla chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />Now amatni cham <char style="w">takhangra</char> pren kowi tarip kowh, ‘Anging changta angak khai, anging tawita mata khai bowt,’ pahai en tut-e awr taphuang chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />Now nami pren kowi plawng hown sak hown en prakowi uang dang hai amatni pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren pra, en lang kloah mih marow pra, en vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih chup kim prakowi dang se en tut-e awr lü awr leng büah chepaw naia. <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />Nakhowk khe en uowi rah mukuang pren hownia amatni awr lü mih dow hawt sünta pe diah, <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />en kowi kingküala mih angak changta mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi lawtta diah. Amatni kowi khümla mih maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowi nasanaah kownkow peah saktuak diah. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa dow en kowh maru chowtaih. Amatni dow Aigupta pren hownia kowh en uang lawtla mih en kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai. Amatni kowi dow chawrla lawngha mih khuang maih hownia kowh uang lawt mih iawng en uang lawtla mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“En kowh nar hai en kowh maru Israeluüa uang lü uang leng hai kar se uang lü khowng khe hawt sünta anging diah. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, anging kowh pipu-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia en uang lawtla khe en kowh nar Mosi hownia mami laiklow en phuangah khai: Ang matia kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng kownkow lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten hownia Israeluüa kowi ang lang klota khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih tua kung now mukuang prakowi chawk rut se CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü awr tek kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara pur hownia awr rü khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Aia dow awr rü hanow aia ria kowi kowh takua talawm mih Israeluüa maten kowi maiawng hai atünma peah prasi khai: <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Aia kowh laikham iawng aia kowh maru Israeluüa kowi pe tanaiah mih CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow nape anging iungra kownkow aia kowh nar Mosi tut-e kowh takhamta mih lai maten uang pe tachiah bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />A-i kowh pipu-uüa hown tawi uowi reng iawng CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow a-i tut-e paw pacham tawi uowi reng lah; aia dow tawng khe paw hang pacham powtta a-i lah. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Aia kowh tiama kowi nanowng mangla kownkow hai a-i pipu-uüa tut-e kowh aia peah mih ari aiang hai rirow maten a-i nanowng chünla kownkow aia dow pacham khowng a-i lah. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Aia dow ang awr lü awr leng mih laiklow maten ni-ni uar-uar sak kowi pacham towah reng lah. Aia kowh maru Israeluüa hai amatni kowh mang kowi pacham tangila reng lah, now ni towng kowh amatni lakke mih iawng aia pacham peah reng lah. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai, aia klen kowi akeng mih thuraiuüa uowi dowi bowt pami lusa kowi kowh maru maten natuk kown towbowt. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow hai ana pek nachün kownkow enni kowh saktuak maten CHAKRAMANG prakowi ani kowh uowi iawng pur prakowi paw pacham uowi reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ap Thurai chup kim khe kowh chang tawncher phuchua mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn hai aia hown kowh Israeluüa maten CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chang phuchua pawi khai. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Nami khin khe mang Sawlawmawn mih chia 22,000 pum hai ruapur 120,000 pum hown taking tasangra uanap pawi chang khai. Naiawng Thurai chup kim dow mang Sawlawmawn hai Israeluüa maten ap-ah khai.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Ap Thurai chup kim mih ni khe mang Sawlawmawn mih Thurai chup kim pur kowi kowh kimpuk dawnglang kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah parah khai. Nami aia lang kraah mih arah kowi aia dow tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap chang pe khai, now taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher sau dow changla phuchua müa khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh uowi mih kri hown kowh phuchuara dow naiawngün phuchua maten nachang kownkow arah sowmchow chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih aia hown kowh uowi mih Israeluüa maten hown nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pur kowi laitali ni mowr chang pawi khai: Ranit ni mowr dow phuchuara ap pawi, now akeng mih ranit ni mowr dow Te Pawi chekhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow maru iun lainowmma kawm khai; amatni dow Hamat süng hownia Aigupta pren kowi kowh tui kangma mih aw mowr süng maten hownia kowh uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Now pawi chur kowh auai ni dow mang Sawlawmawn mih maru maten kowi pe mangta khai bowt. Anar David kowi hai aia kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG peah iungra mih maten rakowi maru maten mang Sawlawmawn kowi tekla pe awmrawm lai now awmrawmma hai apiawma kim prakowi mang büah khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn dow Thurai chup kim, aia kowh kim hai aia nau iawng nathawpah kown mih maten ki thawpta khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Nami kung kowi dow Gibeawn marow kowi aia tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng pe khe kowh iawng uang plan tatüng pe khai iawk. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e en uang lü uang leng mih ang ta khowk chekhai. Now en thawpah mih Thurai chup kim dow ang kowh uowi rah pami ang vüi ang chimsaita khowk. Ang kowh mik hai ang kowh sak dow nami kim prakowi atungma nauowi reng kown towbowt.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />“Now en che en pa David iawng saktuak saima hai <char style="w">achinawmma</char> hown ang tiama kowi mang khai hanow, now ang kowh ana pek, ari arow hai ari aiang maten chün khai hanow <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />Israeluüa luk kowi en kowh mang chowm rah mih chowngchowng saksakma anikma ang natow en kown. Mami laiklow lawnguan kowi en pa David tut-e takham se ang tek pe mih, ‘Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi nachowm mang kown mih maru en krungchak hownia mapaw nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />“Nachenganchepaw enni lah, enni kowh chauüa lah powtta ang khai, ang kowh ana pek hai ari arow chün dowi, now akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi cham tawi chupiia khai, now amatni pur kowi tawi tabawk khai hanow <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />enni Israeluüa kowi kowh ang pe enni mih pren hownia ang naprütta enni kown. Now mami Thurai chup kim ang kowh uowi rah ang vüi ang lang klota khowk mih paw ang mik hownia ang namata pe kown. Nakhowk khe dow Israeluüa mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e kharera hai rensi kau nachowng kown. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Now mami Thurai chup kim mih kawmat kri kraingma chepaw nakhowk khe dow mami ria iawng mang miuüa mih natakrow kown, now khareah se natek kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow mami pren hai mami Thurai chup kim kimluk kowi naiawng CHAKRAMANG tuk changah khai chow?’ napa kown. <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Nakhowk khe akeng mih maru-uüa naklangah kown mih, ‘Naiawng CHAKRAMANG changah mih auan dow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla mih CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi nuata büah rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia khai, now amatni pur kowi tawi tabawk khai. Naiawngün piakra amatni luk kowi CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe mih dow naiawng rakowi chowbowt,’ napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn changah mih akeng lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kim hai aiamat kowh kim mang Sawlawmawn chang mih dow 20 ning chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Sur pren kowi kowh mang Hiram mih mang Sawlawmawn lakke mowr sidar singh, karpowng singh hai kuh ün peah khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn mih mang Hiram kowi Galili pren kowi kowh kua peah 20 kua khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Now mang Hiram dow naiawngün kua nauang mü kownkow Sur pren hownia uang tarü khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün kua uang khita hanow aia dow sak-ih dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn kowi aia tek pe mih, “Aw tainau, tawng iawng mih kua chowbowt chow en pe ang?” pekhai. Now naiawngün kua ming dow Kabul pren pahai aia chap pe khai. (Kabul pami auan dow “kaah tawngkeng dowi” pami chekhai). Naiawngün kua ming dow kawmat pat naiawng chowreng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowi Hiram peah mih kuh dow bowkbowk kowi 4,000 set lak-e hu chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Lup chang miuüa kowi kür hown mang Sawlawmawn pe changah mih dow Thurai chup kim hai aia kowh kim chekhai. Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow satlawt pra kowh arema mih arah kowi paw aia pe thiaah bawn khai. Now Jerusalem marow tap, Hazawr marow tap, Megido marow tap hai Gezer marow tap paw aia pe thawpah khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Nami dowi rawn khe Aigupta pren mang Faraw mih Gezer marow kowpowngta now towkta pe khai, now nakowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi dow saita bowk khai. Nami apiaknama mih marow dow akung kowi mang Sawlawmawn pawah mih aia kowh chama kowi aiawng krawi peah khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn mih Gezer marow dow krawi plan rawah khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Adak Bet-Hawrawn marow, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Balat marow hai Juda süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Tamar marow paw krawi raw khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />Now chakkham nungra marow maten, kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa vüi marow ün aia thawp pe khai. Aia dow Jerusalem, Lebanawn hai aia krüa kowi kowh uowi mih pren maten kowi aia nau thawpah kown mih srui krawi thawpta bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20-21" />Naiawngün lup nachang kownkow kür hown mang Sawlawmawn pe changah lup mih maru-uüa dow Israel chenchapuüa nadowi chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Amawruüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa chekhai. Amatni dow Israeluüa nowng saiah dowi kowh ta sing miuüa chekhai. Amatni dow ani mowr paw chang nar lup büah reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 9:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi tarapdow aia pe changah nar lup dowi chekhai. Nami takcha Israeluüa kowi dow tasen mih siphai, aia kowh maru iuk, aia dak kowi kowh pren kruitown mih, aia kowh siphai aluchow, aia kowh kawrnga kari te mih hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphai hawmh aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Nami klen kowi lup chang miuüa kowi naming nakhet kownkow maru iukuüa 550 ia kowi mang Sawlawmawn peah kurdik khai.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Now mang Sawlawmawn kowh masi Faraw chama dow David marow hownia lawt hanow aia vüi kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawp pe mih kim kowi uang uowi khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih Jerusalem marow satlawt pra kowh arema mih arah maten kowi krawi thia pe bawn khai.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />CHAKRAMANG vüi aia thawpah mih phuchuara kowi mang Sawlawmawn mih tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap paning kowi sum kat chi chang reng chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nam iungma mih maikhük paw towkla reng khai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nam iungma mih maikhük paw towkla reng khai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>. Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih CHAKRAMANG kowh chup kim ki changta khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Nami klen kowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Eziawn-Geber marow kowi mih <char style="w">chawnlawng</char> paw ahuma thawp khai. Nami marow dow Edawm pren kowi kowh sata Rik ria kowi kowh Elawt marow re-e chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Now mang Sawlawmawn kowh maru-uüa hown chawnlawng kowi nauang pe tawi changah lup kownkow mang Hiram mih chawnlawng te akiakma mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi uang chin pe sangrum khai. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Amatni bowkbowk dow Ofir pren kowi chawnlawng hown kowkowiah hanow mang Sawlawmawn vüi uang pawla pe kuh 16,000 set ngia khai.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn tut-e Seba pren masiuüa mang uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh ming iung nang iung hai aia hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG rowsira tatüng mih laiklow dow Seba pren kowi kowh masiuüa mang mih tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa mang dow Sawlawmawn kowi nauang chaingah kownkow uang khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Aia dow maru kawm hai <char style="w">ut</char> hawmh ün uang pawla now Jerusalem marow kowi uang khai. Ut luk kowi dow nam iungma mih chap, kuh hai asung khakma mih hua ahuma aia uang pawla khai. Aia dow mang Sawlawmawn tut-e uang ting hanow aia sak kowi kowh lüntakra uowi mih maten lüntaah khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Now Sawlawmawn dow nami masiuüa uang lüntaah mih maten hawt tek pe khai. Aia nowng klangah dowi mih akratma mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Nahanow nami masiuüa mang dow Sawlawmawn chanlaima pami tuk khai bowt. Aia dow Sawlawmawn thawpah mih mang kim paw khi khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />Nami klen kowi pawitang kowi kowh chakkham ün, aia maru iukuüa kowh uowi rah ün, aia maru-uüa khupah mih tawnguat klangiungma mih ün, aia kowh tui pek mih maru-uüa kowi ün hai CHAKRAMANG kim kowi changla tikah mih uanap mih tawncher hu mih ün paw nami masiuüa mang khila khai. Naiawngün khita hanow aia dow awda khai.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ang matia pren kowi ang uowi khe kowh en kowh lup hai en kowh chanlaira lawnguan kowi ang ta mih na khai nowm! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Nachenganchepaw makowi uangah khükhü ang mik hown ang uang khi dowi matchang naiawngün lawnguan ang owm dowi chekhai. En lawnguan kowi kowh ang tawi taah mih dow dawnglang khowm uowi dowi tak chekhai. En kowh chanlaira hai dawngthawnguan dow maru uang tek ang mih lak-e lang hu chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />En kowh maru iukuüa dow lainowmma kaucha iuk! Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow en pur kowi uowi reng hai en kowh chanlaira laiklow ta reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow awmrawm en kowh Israel kowi kowh mang chowm rah kowi pe chowm en khai. Aia dow Israeluüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma sakrauah reng rakowi tara nowm hai <char style="w">achinawmma</char> nauowila reng kownkow thawp en mang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Seba mang mih mang Sawlawmawn kowi kuh 4,000 set lak-e hu, nam iungma mih chap hai asung khakma mih hua ün ahuma peah khai. Nam iungma mih chap mang Sawlawmawn kowi Seba mang peah mih khowt pren kowi katpaw uang ting dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />(Nami klen kowi Hiram kowh chawnlawngün dow Ofir hownia kuh ün uang pawla pe khai. Now almuk singh ahuma hai asung khakma mih hua ün paw uang pawla khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow naiawngün almuk singh mih CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim vüi changla achüng khai, now meng sarauüa vüi tingteng hai taraw paw aia thawpla khai. Naiawng khowt mih almuk singh hu dow ani mowr kowi katpaw pren kowi uang pawla dowi tak chekhai, khi paw khi dowi tak chekhai).<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih masiuüa mang Seba lüah mih maten pe pe khai. Nami klen kowi aia tut-e kowh uang miuüa kowi hawt peah reng mih awmrawm sung paw nami masiuüa kowi aia peah khai. Nami kung kowi dow masiuüa mang mih aia kowh maru-uüa hown aiamat pren kowi mang khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh dawngthawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Ning towng mang Sawlawmawn tut-e kuh uang ting reng mih dow 25,000 set ngia chi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Nami klen kowi kun chang miuüa, Arab pren manguüa hai Israel pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa hownia paw mangmu uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16-17" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih phengah mih kuh hown kawngma aiukma mih 200 klüng hai achachow mih 300 klüng thawpla khai. Naiawngün aiukma mih kawngma lowk kowi kuh lakke mih dow raiat set ngia chi, now kawngma achachow mih kowi dow lowk kowi pre set ngia chi chekhai. Naiawngün dow Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="1KI 10:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Akung kowi mang Sawlawmawn mih ngasai sa hown mang chowm rah aiukma mih thawp lowk khai, now nami mang chowm rah dow kuh achangma mih hown sowah khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19-20" />Nami mang chowm rah dow apün müa abowk uowi taruk bowk chekhai. Naiawngün abowk towng mapra ret lowk paipra ret lowk chi krangsi rup uowi laipre buk chekhai. Nami mang chowm rah kung pra kowh tane müa aluk prakowi dow uilumma chekhai. Now chowm rah hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi dow bawng tangra uowi chekhai, now bawng tangra ria kowi dow krangsi rup iowng dawnglawng chekhai. Naiawng mih mang chowm rah dow akeng pren kowi miapaw thawp dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Sawlawmawn kowh tui kham bia dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Now Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim kowi kowh pu bia aikam paw achangma mih kuh hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe dow tai mih mapaw asung uowi dowi. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih uanh tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh chawnlawng paw cham tawi chang kun kownkow mang Hiram kowh chawnlawng hown cham tawi kowi reng chekhai. Naiawngün chawnlawng dow sum ning e pakat chi uang plan hanow kuh, tai, ngasai sa, iuk hai uahaw ün uang pawla reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn dow lusa kowi kowh akeng mih manguüa maten lak-e lang kureng hai lang chanlai chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Sawlawmawn kowi kowh Thurai peah mih chanlaira hownia kowh laiklow nauang tawi sünta kownkow pren maten hownia maru uang reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Uang miuüa maten dow kuh uanh tai uanh, khupdip tawngklai, rutchün khawkleng, nam iungma mih chap, kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük ün mang Sawlawmawn vüi uang pawla pe reng chekhai. Aia dow naiawng ning towng hawt ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Naiawng hai Sawlawmawn dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga mih ahuma kramta khai. Aia kowh kawrnga kari kawm dow 1,400 klüng, now kawrnga kawm dow 12,000 pum chekhai. Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih kowi dow kawrnga kari towk rah marow kowi aia towah khai, now tawngbak mih kowi dow aia uowi rah Jerusalem marow kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tai hu krang dow hua iawng towbowt, now sidar sing hu krang paw awkaw kowi kowh uidut singh iawng towbowt. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh kawrnga dow Aigupta pren hai Kilikia marow hownia kowh uang pawla mih chekhai. Mang kowh kun chang miuüa naiawngün dow Kilikia hownia kowh uang ranla mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang ranla mih kawrnga hai kawrnga kari sung dow lowk kowi tai raiat set ngia chi chekhai. Naiawngün kawrnga hai kawrnga kari dow kun chang miuüa mih Hituüa hai Siriauüa kowh manguüa tut-e cham sumah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh angak ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow Faraw kowh chama klen kowi paw prenlang masiuüa kowi naukhila mih akawmma tak chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh dow Moabuüa, Amawnuüa, Edawmuüa hai Hit chenchapuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Naiawngün chenchap masiuüa lawnguan kowi alai hownia CHAKRAMANG tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Amatni kowi enni naia chawng kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow enni kowh saktuak klowita enni hanow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi nape chupiiala enni ngengche kown chekhai,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw mang Sawlawmawn dow naiawngün masiuüa hawmh kowi hing naukhita chenchen khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Aia kowh dow masi uowi 700 ia chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh dow mang chama kangowh chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia <char style="w">changla masi mih narma</char> paw uowi 300 ia chekhai. Naiawngün aia kowh masi hawmh dow aia kowh saktuak mih Thurai hownia plengta pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Sawlawmawn lawngtang mih khin khe aia kowh saktuak dow amasi hawmh mih amatni kowh thuraiuüa prakowi pawla khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn kowh saktuak dow apa David kowh saktuak iawng Thurai tut-e kaah sakowm dowi chekhai. Apa David dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Sawlawmawn dow Sidawnuüa kowh thuraima Astarawt hai Amawnuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih thurai Milkawma kowi tawi chupiia khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Naiawng hai aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi apa David ringkaw iawng sak maiow hown ringkaw dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Sawlawmawn dow Jerusalem marow satlawt prakowi kowh hungh kowi arah kroma mih kowi thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow Moabuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih thurai Kemaws vüi hai Amawnuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih thurai Molek vüi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Prenlang hownia kowh aia kowh masi maten dow amatni chowlowkkow thurai vüi nam iungma mih maikhük towk reng chekhai, now tawncher hown paw chang phuchua reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow amatni bowkbowk vüi thawp pe phuchuara khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow mang Sawlawmawn luk kowi lainowmma sak-hiah kawm khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tut-e kowh uang tatüng pre kat mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai hownia aia kowh saktuak cham tapleng khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi nachupiia dowi kown mih CHAKRAMANG dow Sawlawmawn kowi hangah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Sawlawmawn dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Sawlawmawn mih, “En dow akiang ngakma chekhai, now ang kowh sangbowk laitawm hai ari arow paw en chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi pren mih dow en hownia ang narupta en ngengche kown, now nami pren dow en kowh nar lowk ia mih kowi ang napeah kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />En pa David tut-e kowh ang kowh laikham rakowi en sing uowi sak uowi mowr dow nami pren mih ang narupta en kown nadowi tak. Nachenganchepaw en chapa rut hownia nami pren dow ang narupta kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Tawkche nami pren dow aia kowi ang narupta pe bowk kown nadowi. Ang kowh nar David tut-e kowh ang kowh laikham rakowi hai ang kloah mih Jerusalem marow rakowi en kowh chapa kowi mih ang napeah krungchak lowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh ransu-uüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih mang Sawlawmawn kowi nakingküaah kownkow awr iowng pe ransu lowk ia khai. Nami maru dow Edawm prenchak Hadad chekhai. Aia dow Edawm pren kowi kowh mang krungchak hownia kowh uang dia mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Edawm pren kowi mang David kowsen mih khin khe aia kowh siphai aluchow Joab dow Israel siphaiuüa uak nakowtawi dup kownkow Edawm pren kowi kowtawi khai. Nakowi aia uowi mih khin khe aia dow Edawm chenchap kachakuüa maten kowi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Joab hai Israeluüa kowh siphai maten dow taruk la mowr Edawm pren kowi uowi khai, now amatni dow nami pren kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Nachenganchepaw Hadad mih Edawm pren kowi kowh a-pa kowh maru iukuüa kowi pawla pre sum ia now Aigupta pren kowi ku powt khai. Nami khin khe aia dow sowm reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Amatni dow Midian pren hownia lawt hanow Paran pren kowi kowkowi khai. Nami kung kowi nami pren hownia pawla maru sangrum now Aigupta pren mang Faraw tut-e kowkowi büah khai. Mang Faraw dow Hadad kowi mih kim, krawng bawn hai chakkham peah khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Faraw mih Hadad kowi lainowmma sak-ihah khai. Naiawng rakowi Hadad kowi mih aia kowh masi Tapenes kowh naumow hown Faraw pe tachawngah khai. Tapenes dow masiuüa mang chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Now Hadad kowh masi dow kum nau hanow pen chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Genubat chekhai. Now Genubat kowi dow iawn kham towng dowi mowr Tapenes mih mang kim kowi towah khai. Now Genubat dow nakowi Faraw kowh chauüa hawmh hown tawi taiua uowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Mang David kowng khai bowt pami satang hai aia kowh siphai aluchow Joab kowng khai bowt mih satang dow Aigupta pren kowi uowi reng tak khe Hadad mih ta khai. Nakhowk khe Faraw kowi Hadad tek pe mih, “Khaleng dow ang matia pren kowi pe mang ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Now Hadad kowi Faraw lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en matia pren kowi en naplan kown en nau khai? Makowi tawng akhawr chow en kowh uowi khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Nakhowk khe Hadad klangah mih, “Tawng akhawr paw uowi dowi chow. Nachenganchepaw pe mang ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Thurai dow Sawlawmawn kowi nakingküaah kownkow uang plan iowng pe ransu lowk ia khai iawk. Nami dow Eliada chapa Rezawn chekhai. Aia dow Zoba pren mang Hadadezer hownia ku powt mih chekhai. Mang Hadadezer dow aia kowh kim iah chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Zoba prenchak siphaiuüa kowi mang David saita mih kung kowi Rezawn dow kua maru sangrum hanow thawp damra pathum khai, now aia dow nami damra thum kowi aluchow chekhai. Amatni dow Damaska marow powngta pe khai, now Rezawn dow nami pren kowi chowm mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Mang Sawlawmawn sing uowi sak uowi mowr Rezawn dow Israeluüa kowi kingküaah khai. Nami khin khe Hadad paw Israeluüa kowi kingküaah khai. Rezawn dow Israeluüa kowi lainowmma suiah khai, now aia dow Siria pren kowi chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowi achapa Jaroboam kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam paw mang Sawlawmawn kowi kingküaah khai. Jeroboam dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh maru iuk chekhai. Aia dow Zereda marow kowi kowh Efraim chenchap chekhai. A-u dow Zerua chekhai; aia dow mamaimow chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowi Jeroboam kingküaah mih auan dow maiawng. Akat khe Jerusalem marow satlawt pra kowh arema mih arah maten kowi mang Sawlawmawn mih krawi thia pe bawn khai, now David marow tap tapiak mih arah dow aia mih krawi rawah khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Nami khin khe Jeroboam dow nakowi tawi chang lup khai, now lup iung rakowi aia dow ming nang apawma chekhai. Klanguüa Jeroboam klangiungma tuk chang lup mih dow mang Sawlawmawn khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Jeroboam kowi mih Josef krungchakuüa hownia kowh sukkri kowi miuüa luk kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik peah khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Pani khe Jeroboam mih Jerusalem marow uat kowi cham kowi pakat khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow tiama rawng kowi mih Silo marow hownia kowh risi Ahija hown takrum khai. Nami tiama kowi dow amatchi pre ia klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Ahija buk kowi dow uanpowngchow sar uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Nakhowk khe Ahija dow aia buk kowi kowh uanpowngchow pawah hanow thekah laipre thek khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Nami kung kowi aia dow Jeroboam kowi tek pe mih, “Naiawngün uan sek iu pawah hamüt sek diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek en mih, ‘Sünta diah, mang Sawlawmawn hownia pren mih ang nasekta pe kown, now en kowi mih hamüt chenchap ang nape en kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh nar David tut-e kowh ang kowh laikham rakowi hai Israel krungchak maten kowh arah hownia ang kloah mih Jerusalem marow rakowi Sawlawmawn tut-e nauowi pakrungchak kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Aia kowi dow naiawng ang nape phawah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ang kowi nuata ang hanow Sidawnuüa kowh thuraima Astarawt, Moabuüa kowh thurai Kemaws hai Amawnuüa kowh thurai Milkawma kowi cham chupiia khai. Aia dow apa David chang iawng chang dowi chekhai: Aia dow ang tiama kowi mang dowi, aia dow ang mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai, now ang kowh ari arow hai ana pek paw chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Nachenganchepaw mang Sawlawmawn hownia mih pren maten ang napawta pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kloah mih ang kowh nar David dow ang kowh ana pek hai ang kowh ari arow maten chün khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn kowi dow chownglawng prat ang nape chowmah mang kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Tawkche achapa hownia dow hamüt chenchap ang napawta kown. Now naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi dow ang nape en kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Ang kowh uowi rah iawng hai ang kloah mih Jerusalem marow kowi dow ang kowh nar David kowh chapa mih maibu iawng ang pur kowi atungma pacham uowi lowk ia lah. Achapa kowi dow ang napeah pachenchap kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Now Israel pren kowi ang nape chowm en mang kown; now nakowi mih en sak nau iawng en nachowm mang kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />En che ang kowh nar David iawng ang ana pek chün khai, ang tiama kowi mang khai, ang kowh ari arow hai ana pek chün khai, now ang mik mük kowi iung iawng chang khai hanow ang natawi uowila en reng kown taih. Now mang David kowi kowh ang chang pe iawng en krungchakuüa kowi dow mangra mih anikma ang nachangah kown. Now Israel kowi dow en kowi ang nape en kown. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Sawlawmawn kowh ngak rakowi David krungchakuüa kowi dow ang napeah ripra kown. Nachenganchepaw nami ripra dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi nadowi chekhai,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Jeroboam kowi nasaita kownkow sangkrang khai. Tawkchedow naiawng nasaiah kown mih tuk hanow Jeroboam mih Aigupta pren mang Sisak tut-e kowpowt khai. Now aia dow mang Sawlawmawn kowng dowi mowr nakowi uowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe kowh aia kowh changah mih lup lawnguan hai prengia laiklow aia tekla mih maten dow “Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Israel chenchap maten luk kowi 40 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Nami kung kowi aia dow kowng hanow a-pa David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Rehoboam mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Mang Rehoboam kowi Israel hamüt chenchap kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Rehoboam kowi nathawpah mang kownkow Israeluüa maten mih Sekem marow kowi kowkowi khai. Naiawng rakowi Rehoboam paw Sekem kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Rehoboam chowm mang kown mih satang tata hown krowksang Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam mih Aigupta pren hownia uang plan khai bowt. (Aigupta pren kowi Jeroboam cham uowi mih dow Sawlawmawn hownia cham powt rakowi chekhai). <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa dow Jeroboam kowi kowhawah khai, now amatni bowkbowk dow mang Rehoboam tut-e kowkowiah hanow tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“En pa Sawlawmawn dow sing uowi reng tak khe lup akratma mih kür hown pe chang anging reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en dow anging luk kowi kowh akratma mih lup eta anging nown diah. Nahanow anging nachang en lup reng kown taih,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Nakhowk khe Rehoboam klangah mih, “Pe ang khin büah sum ni diah, ang paw pe tuak tak. Sum ni kowh ni khe uang büah iawk,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow plan mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Now Rehoboam mih a-pa Sawlawmawn chowng khe kowh prengia pek mih lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e krawi paw prengia khai. Lawngtanguüa kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Maru kawmuüa kowi tawng iawng chow ang naklangah kown? Pe ang prengia büa madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Nakhowk khe lawngtang aluchowuüa tek pe mih, “En che amatni kowh lup chang mih chekhai, now amatni kowi che klangiungma klowpah klangah khai hanow amatni mih atungma nachang en nar lup kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Nachenganchepaw Rehoboam dow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowh prengia laiklow chün dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia hown asawn sang mih aia kowh prengia pek mih auiuauüa tut-e krawi paw prengia khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Aia kowh prengia pek mih klanguüa hawmh kowi aia tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa tek ang mih, ‘En pa pe chang anging mih lup akratma mih eta anging nown diah,’ pakhai. Nami lawnguan kowi tawng iawng chow enni pe ang prengia kown? Maru kawmuüa kowi tawng iawng chow a-i naklangah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Nakhowk khe klanguüa hawmh tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Apa kowh kelang lak-e ang kowh rut chah lang iuk. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Apa pe chang enni mih lup klen kowi ahuma tak ang pe chang enni kown. Apa dow leng hown taih tak hup enni. Tawkche ang dow lawngha chuh leng hown ang nahup enni kown,’ pape bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Now mang kowh laiklow iawng sum ni kowh ni dow Jeroboam hai Israeluüa maten mih Rehoboam tut-e kowkowi khai iawk. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Nakhowk khe mang Rehoboam dow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowh prengia pek nuata hanow maru kawmuüa kowi angakma klangah khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Aia dow klanguüa hawm kowh prengia pek iawng tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Apa pe chang enni mih lup klen kowi ahuma tak ang nape chang enni kown. Apa dow leng hown taih tak hup enni. Tawkche ang dow lawngha chuh leng hown ang nahup enni kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Naiawng hai mang Rehoboam dow maru kawmuüa kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng phaw mih dow CHAKRAMANG pe phawah kowh chekhai. Nami dow Nebat chapa Jeroboam lawnguan kowi kowh Silo marowchak risi Ahija tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng uang tachih mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh pren tabak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Mang Rehoboam mih amatni kowh laiklow sünta pe kown nadowi pami tukta hanow Israeluüa tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 12:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“David luk kowi tawngpaw a-i kowh alow uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Jese chapa tut-e tawngpaw a-i kowh kakbak uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Aw Israeluüa, chowlowkkow kim kowi plan büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Aw Rehoboam, en matia krungchakuüa kowi ta kruitown bowt!” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 12:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow chowlowkkow kim kowi plan bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Rehoboam nimkrüa kowi ta uowi mih dow Juda krungchakuüa marow kowi kowh Israeluüa krowngchow towbowt.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Adoniram dow kür hown maru kawmuüa kowi pe changah lup mih kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Israeluüa kowi nauang planla kownkow Adoniram kowi mang Rehoboam kowchinah chowdiah. Tawkche Adoniram kowi mih kowng pat hua hown maru kawmuüa hawt kuakah khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Rehoboam dow alenma aia kowh kawrnga kari kowi pün now Jerusalem marow kowi powt khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Naiawng hai tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa dow ani mowr David krungchakuüa kowi kingküaah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Now Aigupta pren hownia Jeroboam uang plan khowk pami Israeluüa tuk bowk khe dow takua talawmra kowi Jeroboam kowi hawah khai, now Israeluüa maten luk kowi amatni dow Jeroboam kowi pe chowmah mang khai. David krungchak luk kowi kaah sakowmma hown uowi mih dow Juda krungchakuüa krowngchow towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboam kowi risi Semaia hangah tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Rehoboam dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowting hanow Juda krungchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa maten kowi kuaah khai. Now siphai lang iung miuüa kowi 180,000 ia aia lang ruiah khai. Naiawng aia chang mih dow tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa kowi senah hanow amatni kowh pren aia powngta pe kown nau rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Nachenganchepaw risi Semaia kowi Thurai uang tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Juda pren mang Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam, Juda krungchakuüa, Benjamin krungchakuüa maten hai akeng miuüa maten kowi en natek pe kown mih, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‘Enni kowh tainau Israeluüa hown nakowtasen kownkow hangkow tarü büa diah; enni mih chowlowkkow kim kowi plan büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng phaw mih dow ang nauah kowh chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng kim prakowi plan bowk khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeroboam chup rup mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Akung kowi Israel kowi kowh mang Jeroboam dow Efraimuüa süng kowi kowh Sekem marow mih akhawtma kowplan thawpah khai, now nakowi kowuowi khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia powt now Penuel marow mih khawtma kowplan thawp khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26-27" />Jeroboam ka tuak mih, “Ang che tawngpaw chang dowi reng hanow maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi nakowphuchua kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh taklowp taklangra te kowi nakowkowi reng kown lowmow. Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow mang Rehoboam krüa kowi nauowi kown mih nau büah iawk kown lowmow. Pren mih dow David krungchak rut kowi napowt iawk kown chekhai. Now ang kowi dow nasaita ang büah kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 12:26-27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Naiawng rakowi mang Jeroboam mih aia kowh maru-uüa tut-e paw prengia hanow kuh hown thawp chia chah rup pre buk khai. Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Aw Israeluüa, sünta. CHAKRAMANG kowi nachup kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi enni kowkowi kla dowi bowt. Mami chowbowt enni kowh thurai. Mami chowbowt Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla enni mih thurai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Lowk mih chia chah rup dow Bethel marow kowi aia towah khai, now alowk mih dow Dan marow kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow Bethel hai Dan marow kowi kowh arup kowi chup hai chang lup ngak khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Jeroboam mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi thawp pe thurai chup kim khai, now Levi krungchak nadowi miuüa kowi ruiah hanow pe changah uamow lup khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Now Juda süng kowi kowh kawngmu pawi phaw reng iawng raiat la kowi kowh laitanga ni khe Bethel marow kowi aia paw chang pawi lowk khai. Nakhowk khe aia thawpah mih chia chah rup vüi phuchuara luk kowi aia mih chang tawncher phuchua khai. Now Bethel marow kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi aia thawpah mih thurai chup kim kowi aia tow pe uamow khai. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Bethel kowi kowh aia thawpah mih phuchuara kowi raiat la kowi kowh 15 ni mih ni khe aia dow tawncher phuchua chang pe khai. Naiawng nachang kown mih pawi ni dow aiamat hownia kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Naiawng hai aia dow Israeluüa vüi kamrüt pe pawi khai, now aiamat ngengche mih phuchuara luk kowi chang tawncher phuchua khai.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Bethel kowi kowh phuchuara napiak kown mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Akat khe Jeroboam mih nachang tawncher phuchua kownkow phuchuara re-e iowng dawnglawng khai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng Juda süng hownia kowh risi mih Bethel kowi aia re-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Nami risi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng phuchuara kowi kingküala mih laiklow atünma uang tek khai. Aia tek mih, “Aw phuchuara! Aw phuchuara! CHAKRAMANG tek en mih, ‘David krungchak hownia Josia pami kachakuüa chah nauang dia lowk ia kown. Aia dow en luk kowi uamowuüa kowi nanawmah kown. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi chang lup miuüa chekhai. Kawmat dow en luk kowi amatni mih chang tawncher phuchua khai. Nachenganchepaw Josia dow en luk kowi mih maru hut nanawm en kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Nami khin khe nami risi plan tek pe mih, “Mami dow CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow chekhai pami amatra maiawng en nakhi kown: Mami phuchuara mih natalak phak kown, now aluk kowi kowh plawi ün dow nadowh bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Jeroboam dow phuchuara hownia nami maru prakowi haichawk se tek mih, “Nami maru kowi dowk büa madiah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw mang haichawkah mih rut dow haichawk hown krowksang hing keu khai. Aia dow aia kowh rut mih hing nowng chü dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Nami klen kowi Thurai risi tekah mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng phuchuara paw talak phak khai, now phuchuara luk kowi kowh plawi ün paw dowh bowk khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Nakhowk khe Thurai risi kowi mang tek pe mih, “Chup ang Thurai diah. Sakrauma hown ang kowh rut mih CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai pacham iungta ang iawk lah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Thurai risi mih chup Thurai hanow mang kowh rut dow aiawng uowi khe kowh iawng plan iung khai iawk.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Now Thurai risi kowi mang tek pe mih, “Ang kim kowi uang tawi hanow tawi cha tawi khamla diah, now en kowh lup rakowi awmrawm sung paw ang nape en lowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai risi klangah mih, “En kowh dawngthawnguan dawnglang mowr en pe ang chepaw en tut-e ang natawi kown nadowi, now chakkham paw ang tawi cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngpaw nacha nakhamla dowi kown mih hai ang uang tarüla mih tiama iawng naplan dowi kown mih CHAKRAMANG pe ang ana khai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia uang tarüla mih tiama iawng plan dowi bowt kowi akeng mih tiama iawng cham mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Nami khin khe Bethel marow kowi risi lawngtang uowi lowk ia chekhai. Nami ni khe kowh tawng ngai chow Thurai risi chang mih risi lawngtang kowi achapauüa uang tek pe khai. Now mang kowi kowh Thurai risi tekla pe mih paw risi lawngtang kowi achapauüa tek pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Nakhowk khe achapauüa kowi a-pa lüntaah mih, “Tawng pra chow nami Thurai risi cham mang?” pakhai. Now achapauüa dow nami Thurai risi tawng pra chow mang mih a-pa lawngtang kowi tek pe büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Nakhowk khe achapauüa kowi risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “Kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau ang uan büa madiah,” pakhai. Now aia tek iawng achapauüa chang pe kung kowi dow aia mih kawrngaramchük luk kowi phüt khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Now aia dow Thurai maru kowi nakrawi cham kownkow tarü khai bowt. Aia dow Thurai maru kowi sasua singh tut kowi chowm phülü mih kowkhi khai. Nakhowk khe aia lüntaah mih, “En chowbowt bow Juda süng hownia kowh uang mih risi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Nakhowk khe Thurai maru klangah mih, “Ow, ang chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Now risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “Chu, ang kim kowi tawi cha tawi khamla diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Nakhowk khe aia klangah mih, “En tut-e paw ang tawi ia tawi dowi tham, now chakkham paw mami süng kowi ang tawi ia cha tawi ia kham dowi tham. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng iawng mih chakkham paw nacha dowi kown mih hai ang uang tarüla mih tiama iawng naplan dowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG pe ang ana khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Now risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “Ang paw en iawng mih risi taih. Ang kim kowi napawla en hanow nape cha en chakkham kownkow CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng <char style="w">kramamu</char> lowk ia mih uang tek ang khai,” pape khai. Tawkchedow nami laiklow dai lai chowtaih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Naiawng rakowi nami risi dow aia tut-e kowtawi plan khai, now nami risi lawngtang kim kowi aia kowtawi cha tawi kham khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Now nacha nakham kownkow pawitang re-e chowm büah thüm khe risi lawngtang tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Juda süng hownia kowh uang mih risi kowi atünma risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow en üata khai, now CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai pe en mih ana en chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Aia hang en mih arah kowi en tawi cha tawi kham khai. Naiawng rakowi en pipu-uüa tadupra kowi en natawi ka tadupra kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Now ki cha ki kham kung kowi dow risi lawngtang mih Thurai maru vüi aia kowh alowk mih kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau pe uan khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Now aia mih nami hownia lawt hanow tiama rawng kowi aia kowi dow krangsi hawt makah hanow kowngta khai. Aia kowh uak dow tiama kowi takuak hüah khai, now aia uak ria kowi dow kawrngaramchük hai krangsi mih iowngla phu khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Nami tiama iawng cham lang mang mih maru-uüa dow uak takuak hüah mih hai aria kowi krangsi iowng dawnglawng mih khila bowk khai. Nami khita now amatni dow risi lawngtang uowi rah Bethel marow kowi kowphowng satang khai.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Nami satang tata now risi lawngtang tek mih, “Nami uak dow Juda süng hownia kowh uang mih Thurai maru uak tangtang. Thurai kowh ana pek aia chün dowi rakowi Thurai tekta iawng krangsi rut kowi aia kowng mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Nami kung kowi achapauüa kowi risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “Ang kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi kowdau ang uan büa madiah,” pakhai. Nahanow achapauüa dow a-pa tek pe iawng chang pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Now aia mih lawt hanow tiama kowi uak takuak hüah mih hai aria kowi kawrngaramchük hown krangsi iowngla dawng mih kowkhi khai. Nami krangsi dow Thurai risi uak mih chaah dowi chekhai, now kawrngaramchük kowi paw tawngpaw changah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Now aia dow nami risi uak nadupah kownkow hai nauowila uiting uangtak kownkow aia kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla hanow Bethel marow kowi kowplan khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Aia dow aia vüi kowi kowh thawpah mih tadupra kowi nami risi uak mih dupah khai. Now achapauüa hown aia dow maiawng hai uowila uiting uangtak khai, “Aw, ang tainau le!” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Nami risi uak ki dupta kung kowi achapauüa kowi risi lawngtang tek pe mih, “Ang kowng khowk khe ang kowh uak mih nami Thurai maru tadupra kowi dup ang büah ba. Ang kowh hut mih nami risi hut ria kowi towah büah ba. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Bethel marow kowi kowh phuchuara hai Samari marow kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi kingküala mih laiklow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng aia phuangah mih dow nauang tachih ngengche kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Nami kung kowi paw Jeroboam dow aia kowh lup ngak hownia uang plan dowi reng tak chekhai. Uang plan lak dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara vüi natow pe uamow kownkow plan rui maru rengreng khai. Aia dow chang uamow lup kown nau mih maru maten kowi pe changah uamow lup khai. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Nami lup ngak dow Jeroboam krungchakuüa mih piak hanow lusa hownia natamala kown mih müa chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Jeroboam kowh chapa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Nami khin khe Jeroboam chapa Abija dow arau uowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Nakhowk khe Jeroboam tek pe amasi mih, “Ang masi pami maru natukla en dowi kownkow akeng mih tawnguat khupla diah. Now Silo marow kowi risi Ahija tut-e kowkowi diah. Israeluüa luk kowi ang nachowm mang kown mih laiklow tek ang mih dow risi Ahija chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />En tarü mih khin khe kawmpah hamüt pa, kanrawn sau hown kowh thawpah mih kawmpah sangrum hai kuai tui sangrum risi Ahija kowi pawla pe diah. Aia dow achi kowh chapa tawng chow naown kown mih natek en kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Nahanow Jeroboam kowh masi dow ahua tek pe iawng chang khai, now aia dow Silo marow kowi risi Ahija kim kowi kowkowi khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Nami khin khe risi Ahija dow lawngtang lai bowt rakowi khi mik dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG tek pe Ahija mih, “Jeroboam kowh masi mih aia kowh chapa arau uowi mih lawnguan kowi nauang lünta kownkow en tut-e uang tarü khowk. Aia klang en iawng aia kowi hawt klangah diah,” pakhai. Now nami masiuüa kowi tawng chow nahawt tek pe kown mih Ahija kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:5">Now Jeroboam kowh masi dow akeng mih masiuüa powm iawng uang thula arup hanow uang tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Naiawng rakowi kimplawt re-e Jeroboam masi uang towm mih khawk san klow tata hanow risi Ahija tek pe mih, “Jeroboam kowh masi ow, alak kowi uang kup bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow akeng mih masiuüa powm iawng en uang tuk thula arup khai? Naphowng en satang ngak kownkow CHAKRAMANG tekta ang khowk. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />En hua Jeroboam tut-e kowmang now maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Maru kawmuüa pungmadawng hownia ang lang klo en khai, now ang maru Israeluüa luk kowi ang thawp en aluchow khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />David kowh krungchak hownia pren mih ang rupah hanow ang pe en khai. Nachenganchepaw en dow ang kowh nar David iawng nadowi chekhai. David dow ang kowh ana pek chün reng, now aia dow sak matiow hown ang tek iawng chang reng chekhai. Aia dow ang mik kowi iung mih lup kangowh chowtaih chang khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Nachenganchepaw en dow rik uowi mih manguüa hownia kawmat mowr kowh manguüa maten lak-e lang chang lup ngak khai. En matia vüi thurai hai <char style="w">arup aren</char> ün en thawpah khai. Naiawng hai en towk ang kunmarau khai, now en kung prakowi en towta ang hüah khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Naiawng rakowi Jeroboam krungchak luk kowi dow alenma ang nauang pawla pe phih kown. Nami phih hown aia krungchak hownia kowh kachakuüa nget kowi nar lah, nar nadowi mih lah ang nakowngta bowk kown. Now Jeroboam krungchak kowi dow mawngchawng chun towk iawng asaima ang namitta kown. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Marow kowi kowh kowng mih aia krungchakuüa kowi dow kui nachaah kown, now dowm kowi kowh kowng miuüa kowi dow uakling uaber hawmh nachaah kown. Mami laiklow dow ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />“Kawmat kim kowi kowplan diah. Marow kowi en kowchawp hown krowksang en chapa nakowng kown. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Now Israel maten dow aia vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak se aia kowi nadupah kown. Jeroboam kowh maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi aia chowtaih naka tadupra kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia luk kowi chowtaih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai sak-ih khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />“CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat vüi Israeluüa luk kowi nape chowmah mang lowk ia kown. Nami mang dow Jeroboam krungchak kowi napiakta bowk kown. Nami piakra dow ani hownia chowbowt. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi napiakah kown. Nahanow amatni dow khownawng tui kowi kowh tapowngla paw mih pram iawng naown kown. Now amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh aia peah mih klangiungma mih pren hownia amatni kowi dow nacham pawla hanow Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi nacham setta plawt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow thawp Asera limpu hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Jeroboam dow chang angak khai, now Israeluüa kowi paw aia pe changla ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih nanuata kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Nahanow Jeroboam kowh masi dow kim prakowi mang khai, now aia dow Tirza marow kowi kowtowm khai. Now kimplawt kowi aia haisan khawk hown krowksang achapa dow kowng khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Now aia kowh nar risi Ahija kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng Israeluüa maten dow achapa vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak se achapa kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Jeroboam kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, tasen lawnguan maten hai chowm mang mih lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Now Jeroboam dow 22 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih kowng khai bowt. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Nadab mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Rehoboam chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Now Juda pren kowi chowm mang mih dow Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam chekhai. Aia dow 41 ning khe chowm mang khai, now Jerusalem marow kowi aia dow lairanit ning mowr chowmla mang khai. Israel chenchapuüa kowh arah maten hownia CHAKRAMANG aiamat nauowiah kownkow kloah mih dow Jerusalem marow chekhai. Rehoboam kowh u dow Amawnuüa chenchap Naima chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Judauüa dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Amatni dow amatni kowh pipu-uüa lak-e chang angak khai. Amatni kowh angak changra hownia amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau ngamlam khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Amatni dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai aram chakma mih singh tut towng amatni vüi thawp chupiiara büah khai. Now chimsaima mih hua hai Asera limpu paw thawp büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Nami klen kowi amatni pren kowi dow akeng thuraiuüa chup kim kowi kowh chang chawkkrawma lup mih masiuüa hai kachakuüa hawmh paw uowi chekhai. Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup dow Judauüa mih tawi chang khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Rehoboam chowm mang mih tanga ning khe Aigupta pren mang Sisak dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowsenah khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Now mang Sisak dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim kowi kowh uowi mih dawngthawnguan maten pawla bowk khai. Aia dow kuh hown kowh Sawlawmawn thawpah mih kawngma ün khowm padow pawla bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Naiawng rakowi mang Rehoboam dow kuh hown kowh kawngma takcha kowi kri hown kawngma mih thawpah khai. Now naiawngün kawngma naming nakhet kownkow aia dow aia kimplawt chawng mih siphaiuüa kowi peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />CHAKRAMANG kim kowi mang kowkowi mih khin khe kangchawng mih siphaiuüa dow naiawngün kawngma dowkla se mang tut-e tawi reng chekhai. Now akung kowi amatni dow naiawngün kawngma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uang towah büah khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Rehoboam changah mih akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow, “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Now Rehoboam kowh siphai hawmh hai Jeroboam kowh siphai hawmh dow atungma tasen reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Akung kowi Rehoboam dow kowng hanow a-pa David marow kowi maru dupah khai. A-u dow Amawnuüa chenchap Naima chekhai. Now Rehoboam takcha kowi achapa Abija mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Abija chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Juda pren kowi Abija chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Abija mih Jerusalem marow kowi sum ning mowr chowm mang khai. A-u dow Abisalawm kowh chama Maka chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Aia dow a-pa changah mih lup ngak maten tawi chang reng chekhai. Aia kowh sak dow a-pu David kowh sak iawng nadowi; aia dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih David tut-e kowh aia takhamta mih laiklow tuakla rakowi Jerusalem marow kowi nachowm mang kownkow hai nami marow natownah reng kownkow Abija kowi peah chapa lowk ia khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow David dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Hit chenchap Uria kowh masi hown chang iang mih klen kowi David dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün dowi mih lowk paw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Rehoboam hai Jeroboam iüah uownla mih tasen dow Abija chowng kowi pachowng mowr uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Abija kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk. Abija hai Jeroboam iüah dow tasen reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Akung kowi Abija dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Asa mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Jeroboam chowm mang mih pirmi ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Aia dow 41 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-pa kowh u dow Abisalawm kowh chama Maka chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa dow a-pu David iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Aia dow aia pren kowi kowh akeng thuraiuüa chup kim kowi chang chawkkrawma lup mih masiuüa hai kachakuüa maten kowi prütta bowk khai, now aia pipu-uüa thawpla mih arup maten paw piakta bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Nami klen kowi aia dow a-pa kowh u Maka kowi khowm padow mang u arah hownia klata khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Maka mih suiiai kaniaima mih Asera limpu thawp lowk chekhai. Nami limpu dow kripta hanow Asa mih Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi cham pawla hanow cham tikah khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten piakta bowk dowi chepaw Asa dow chownglawng prat aia kowh sak mih CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowmma uowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh a-pa matchi lang kraah mih kuh, tai hai akeng mih uanh maten CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowpawla khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Aia chowm mang mowr mih Asa dow Israel mang Basa hown hing tasenta hüah chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Akat khe Israel mang Basa mih Judauüa kowi kowsenah now Rama marow mih kowpowngta pe khai. Now aia dow Rama marow kowi Judauüa ia kup lawtla dowi kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi towah khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Naiawng rakowi Asa mih aia kim kowi kowh hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kuh hai tai maten pawah hanow aia kowh maru iukuüa rut kowi peah khai, now Siria pren mang Ben-Hadad tut-e kowchinah khai. Ben-Hadad kowh pa dow Tabrimawn chekhai, now Tabrimawn kowh pa dow Heziawn chekhai. Nakhowk khe Ben-Hadad chowm mang mih dow Damaska marow kowi chekhai. Ben-Hadad kowi Asa krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Chu, apa hai en pa iüah iawng achi paw tatow sangbowk laitawm diah sik. Naiawngün kuh hai tai dow awmrawm sung iawng hai ang krawi sa en mih chekhai. Israel pren mang Basa hown kowh en tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm kawmat piakta diah, nahanow aia dow ang hownia napowt kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Juda pren mang Asa kowh laiklow tata hanow Ben-Hadad dow nauta khai. Aia dow aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi Israeluüa kowi nakrawi sen kownkow krawi chinah khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow Ijawn marow, Dan marow, Abel-Bet-Maka marow, Galili kanh riaret kowi kowh süng maten hai Naptali süng maten krawi powngta khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Nami satang tata hanow Israel mang Basa mih Rama marow kowi akhawtma nachangah kown mih lup towta hanow Tirza marow kowi kowpowt khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Nami kung kowi dow Rama marow akhawtma changla kownkow Basa tawngah mih hua hai singh nakowkawt kown mih Juda prenchakuüa maten kowi Asa peah ana khai. Now naiawngün singh hai hua maten hown Asa mih Mizpa kua hai Benjamin süng kowi kowh Geba marow akhawtma changah khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Asa kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan, aia cham awng tasen mih lawnguan hai aia krawi thawpla marow sar mih lawnguan maten “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. Tawkche alawngtangma khowk khe Asa kowh dow khawk kowi rawka phaw achap chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Akung kowi Asa dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Nami kung kowi aia takcha achapa Jehosafat mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Nadab chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Israel pren kowi Jeroboam kowh chapa Nadab chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih pre ning khe chekhai. Aia dow Israel pren kowi pre ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow a-pa Jeroboam iawng Israeluüa kowi pe changla angak khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Isakar krungchak Ahija kowh chapa Basa mih Nadab kowi nasaita kownkow sangkrang khai. Aia dow Nadab hai Israel siphaiuüa mih Filistinuüa kowh Gibethawn marow kowi kowsenah khe Gibethawn marow kowi Nadab kowi saiah khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih sum ning khe Basa mih Nadab kowi saita khai, now aia takcha kowi dow Basa mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Aia dow chowm mang hanow Jeroboam kowh kimchakuüa maten kowi saita bowk khai. Naiawng Jeroboam kimchakuüa kowi Basa saita bowk mih dow Silo marowchak risi Ahija tekah mih laiklow uang tachi mih chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Jeroboam dow aiamat chang lup ngak mih klen kowi Israeluüa kowi paw pe changah lup ngak khai. Naiawng aia chang rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih lainowmma kunmarau khai.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Nadab changla mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Juda pren mang Asa hai Israel pren mang Basa iüah dow amatchi chowm mang mowr mih hing tasenta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Basa chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Israel pren kowi Ahija kowh chapa Basa chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih sum ning khe chekhai. Aia dow Tirza marow kowi 24 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia paw Jeroboam iawng dow Israeluüa kowi pe changah lup ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Israel pren mang Basa piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Naiawng Israel pren kowi Basa chowm mang mih khin khe Basa lawnguan kowi Hanani chapa risi Jehu tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Basa, en dow asung uowi dowi mih maru taih diah. Nachenganchepaw ang maru Israeluüa kowh aluchow ang thawp en khai. Tawkche Jeroboam iawng en tawi chang lup ngak khai, now ang maru Israeluüa kowi mih en pe changah lup ngak khai. Naiawng hai en towk ang kunmarau khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Naiawng rakowi en hai en krungchakuüa kowi ang napiakah kown. En krungchakuüa kowi dow Nebat chapa Jeroboam kowh krungchakuüa kowi iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Marow kowi kowh kowng mih en kowh maru-uüa uak dow kui nachaah kown, now marow uat kowi kowh cham kowng miuüa uak dow uakling uaber hawmh nachaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Basa kowh akeng mih lup hai tasen awng mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Akung kowi Basa dow kowng hanow Tirza marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha dow achapa Ela mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Basa hai aia krungchakuüa dow Jeroboam krungchakuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai, now Jeroboam krungchak kowi paw amatni dow saita khai. Basa hai aia krungchakuüa kowi kingküala mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow Hanani chapa Jehu tut-e uang towm mih dow nami rakowi chekhai<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Ela chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Israel pren kowi Basa chapa Ela chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 26 ning khe chekhai. Ela dow Tirza marow kowi pre ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Aia kowh dow Zimri pami siphai aluchow uowi lowk ia chekhai. Zimri dow aia kowi nasaiah kownkow sangkrang khai. Ela dow aia kowh kawrnga kari maten kowi dawnglang mih Zimri kowi pe mingkhetah khai. Now akat khe Tirza marow kowi kowh mang kim mingkhet mih Arza kim kowi Ela kowkham rak khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Nami khin khe Zimri mih nami kim lak kowi kowkupah hanow Ela kowi kowsaita khai, now aia mih ta chowm mang khai. Aia ta chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 27 ning khe chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Zimri dow uown chowm mang hown krowksang Basa krungchak maten kowi saita bowk khai. Aia dow Basa kowh tasin taken mih kachakuüa hai kachakuüa auiuauüa kowi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Basa kowi CHAKRAMANG kingküaah mih laiklow risi Jehu kowi kowh tek pe iawng Zimri mih Basa krungchakuüa kowi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Basa hai achapa Ela iüah dow lainowmma chang lup ngak khai. Amatchi dow Israeluüa kowi pe changah lup ngak khai, now asung uowi dowi mih arup kowi paw pe chupah khai. Naiawng hai amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ela changah mih lup maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Zimri chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Israel pren kowi Zimri chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 27 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow ranit ni mowr Tirza marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Nami khin khe Israel siphai hawmh dow Filistinuüa kowh Gibethawn marow kowrum khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Naiawng tangbung khupra kowi uowi büah thüm khe Israel siphaiuüa mih mang Ela kowi Zimri saita mih satang ta khai. Nami satang ta mih ni khe amatni dow tangbung khupra kowi siphai aluchow Awmri kowi thawpah Israel pren mang büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Nakhowk khe Awmri hai aia tut-e kowh Israeluüa maten mih Gebethawn marow hownia plan hanow Tirza marow mih uang umta lut khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Nakhowk khe Tirza marow mih Awmri thumchakuüa powngta kown towbowt pami tuk hanow Zimri dow mang kim kowi kowh akhawtma mih kim kowi kowkowi khai, now mang kim dow aia krawi towkta bowk khai, now nami maih kowi aia dow tawi hing tasat khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Naiawng aia kowng mih dow aia ngak rakowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow Jeroboam iawng Israeluüa kowi pe changah lup ngak khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Zimri kowh akeng mih lup hai aia kowh kingküa lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Awmri chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih tabak prut hanow phaw pre thum khai. Pathum mih maru-uüa dow Ginat kowh chapa Tibni kowi pe chowmah mang kown mih nau, now alowk mih thumchak dow Awmri kowi pe chowmah mang kown mih nau khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Tawkche Awmri thumchakuüa mih Tibni thumchakuüa kowi nowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Tibni kowi saita hanow Awmri mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Israel pren kowi Awmri chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 31 ning khe chekhai. Israeluüa kowi aia kruitownla mih dow laipre ning chekhai. Aia rik chowm mang mih taruk ning mowr dow Tirza marow hownia chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Nami kung kowi tai 70 set hown Semer hownia Samari chut mih aia ran lowk chekhai. Nami chut luk kowi dow aia thawp marow khai. Now nami chut ming dow aia ranah dowi rawn khe kowh chut iah Semer ming iawng Samari pahai aia chap pe khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Awmri dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow aia dowi rawn khe kowh manguüa lak-e lang chang lup ngak khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Aia dow Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam iawng rowprowp Israeluüa kowi pe changah lup ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi chup hai CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Awmri kowh akeng mih lup hai tasen awng mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Akung kowi Awmri dow kowng hanow Samari marow kowi maru dupah khai. Now aia takcha kowi achapa Ahab mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Ahab chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Israel pren kowi Awmri chapa Ahab chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 38 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow 22 ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Awmri kowh chapa Ahab dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow aia dowi rawn khe kowh manguüa lak-e lang chang lup ngak khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow Ahab tut-e a-echow taih tak chekhai. Aia dow Sidawn marow mang Etbal chama Jezebel hown tachawng khai, now Baal thurai kowi tawi chupiia khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Aia dow Baal thurai vüi Samari marow kowi thawp pe chup kim lowk khai, now phuchuara paw thawp pe lowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Now aia dow Asera limpu paw thawp lowk khai. Aia dowi rawn khe kowh Israel pren kowi rik chowm mang miuüa CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau mih lak-e aia mih lang towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Ahab chowm mang mih khin khe Bethel marowchak Hiel mih Jeriko marow plan thawpah khai. Tawkche naiawng aia uown phük marow chüng mih khin khe dow aia chapa ta Abiram mih kowng khai, now aia thawp marow plawt khe paw aia chapa sawi Segub mih kowng khai. Naiawng achapa kowng mih dow Nun chapa Josua tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG tekta iawng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nun chapa Josua tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG tekta iawng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami laiklow dow Josua 6:26 uan kowi arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> uang phaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Elija kowi uaak uang peah chakkham mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Gilead süng kowi kowh Tisbe marow kowi dow aming Elija pami risi uowi lowk ia. Akat khe aia tek pe mang Ahab mih, “Ang chang pe lup reng mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh masing Thurai ming lüklau se ang tek khowk. Ang tek dowi mowr pre sum ning mowr mih <char style="w">nang</char> paw nakla kown nadowi, now uang paw nauang kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Elija mih, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Mami marow hownia lawt hanow satlawt prakowi kowpowt diah, now Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh tui hawr dawilawi mih Kerit pami awchawng kowi kowtapet diah. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Nakowi dow nami awchawng tui en nakham kown, now nakowi nauang pe en chakkham kownkow uaak hawmh kowi ang khowmta hüah khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng Elija dow chang khai. Aia dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh tui hawr dawilawi mih Kerit pami awchawng kowi kowuowi khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Now uaak hawmh mih rau-e hai iak prakowi aia vüi kawmpah hai chaknga uang sa pe reng chekhai, now tui dow nami awchawng tui aia kham khai.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zarefat marow kowi kowh mamaimow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Pren kowi uang uang dowi rakowi pre sum ni kung kowi dow nami awchawng tui mih kang khai. <verse eid="1KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Nakhowk khe Elija tut-e mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng uang towm khai: <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Kawmat dow Sidawn marow re-e kowh Zarefat marow kowi kowuowi diah. Nakrawi kram en chakkham kownkow nakowi kowh mamaimow kowi ang khowmta en lowk ia khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Naiawng rakowi risi Elija mih Zarefat marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now nami marow tapplawt re-e hawt paw sawp mih mamaimow kowi aia khi lowk ia khai. Nami mamaimow kowi hawah now aia tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown ang khamah kown mih vüi bia hown uang pawla ang tui ditchow dit snow,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Nami mamaimow tarü mih khin khe krawi hawah now aia krawi plan tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown kawmpah paw uang pawla ang apachow dit ba,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Nakhowk khe nami mamaimow klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh masing Thurai ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, ang tut-e apachow paw kawm uowi dowi chekhai. Puh kowi kawmdi uowi pachawmchow taih, now kanrawn sau paw uowi ditchow towbowt. Ang krawi paw sawp mih dow kim kowi napawla kownkow chekhai. Nami sawp hown ang hai ang chapa vüi ang naengla kawm kown. Nami kawm chala now angching uchow dow nakowng kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Nachenganchepaw nami mamaimow kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram diah. Kim kowi kowmang now en tek iawng kowchang diah. Tawkchedow en kowh kawmdi hown chalachow ang vüi kowrik thawp kawmpah apah diah, now nami dow ang tut-e uang pawla diah. Nami kung kowi phai en hai en chapa vüi kawmpah thawp iang. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Uang kowi ang pe uangah dowi mowr kawmdi puh hai sau towk müa natakhaw kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Nahanow nami mamaimow dow risi Elija krawi tek pe iawng kowchang khai. Now Elija, nami mamaimow hai achapa büah dow akhin krama mowr ka cha chakkham khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Elija kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG krawi tek pe iawng kawmdi puh paw takhaw dowi chekhai, now sau towk müa paw takhaw dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Pre sum ni kung kowi dow mamaimow kowh chapa mih arau uowi khai. Now achapa dow arau di lai rakowi hing kowng khai. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Nakhowk khe nami mamaimow tek pe risi Elija mih, “Aw Thurai maru, tawng angak chow ang changta en khai? Ang kowh angak nauang tüng ang kownkow hai ang chapa kowi nauang kowngta kownkow en uang mih bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Nakhowk khe Elija klangah mih, “En kowh chapa kowi uaipe ang madiah,” pape khai. Nahanow risi Elija dow nami mamaimow buk hownia achapa kowi haipawah hanow aluk krowng kowi aia uowiah mih towklak kowi kowpawla khai, now mamaimow kowh chapa kowi mih aia kowh mawk rah kowi iüah khai. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Nami kung kowi Elija tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, ang uowiah mih kim iah mamaimow kowh chapa kowi en kowngta pe hanow tawngplawng kowchow maiawng mih kawm kratra aia luk kowi en uang tuk pawla pe khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Nami kung kowi aia dow nami mamaimow kowh chapa luk kowi iu tamaw sum kat hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi awr tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, mami ngeuüa kowh asak uang singta pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow Elija kowh laiklow hawt sünta pe khai. Nahanow nami ngeuüa kowh asak dow uang sing khai, now aia dow awr ching khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Nakhowk khe dow Elija mih aia uowi rah hownia nami ngeuüa kowi krowngla hanow adak krowng kowi a-u tut-e kowpawla khai. Now a-u kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mow, en kowh chapa sing reng tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Nakhowk khe nami mamaimow tek pe Elija mih, “En Thurai maru pami kawmat dow ang tuk khowk, now CHAKRAMANG tek en mih maten paw anowmma chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ahab tut-e risi Elija uang tatüng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Pren kowi uang uang dowi mih sum ning nga khe Elija kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En mih Ahab hown kowtakrum diah, now pren kowi ang nape uangah uang kown mih kowtek pe diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Naiawng rakowi Elija dow mang Ahab hown kowtakrum kownkow tarü khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Nami khin khe Samari marow kowi dow nachaah kown mih chakkham mapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3-5" />Akat khe mang Ahab mih Obadia kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Pren kowi kowh awchawng hai lawngrawi maten kowi krawi kowi madiah. Now kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük hawmh nachaah kown mih pram uowi ne chünchü krawi sam mü madiah. Naiawng nadowi now kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük hawmh kowi a-i nakowngta bowk kown chekhai,” pakhai. (Nami khin khe Obadia dow mang kim mingkhet mih chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma ringkaw hai owm mih maru chekhai. CHAKRAMANG kowh risiuüa kowi Ahab kowh masi Jezebel saiah mih khin khe aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh risi 100 ia kowi cham petah khai. Aia dow naiawngün risiuüa kowi 50 ia chi bakah now puk pre buk kowi cham petah khai. Now naiawngün risiuüa kowi mih chakkham paw aia peah khai). <verse eid="1KI 18:3-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Now Ahab hai Obadia iüah dow nakrawi cham pram uowi rah kownkow cham tarü iüah khai. Amatchi dow pren mih tabakah iüah hanow mapra lowk ia paipra lowk ia cham tarü iüah khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Now Obadia dow mang mang hanow tiama rawng kowi Elija hown takrum khai. Elija kowi khita now aia dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Ang kowh chakramang Elija chowbowt nadowi bow en?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Elija klangah mih, “Ow, Elija chowbowt ang. En kowh mangkri tut-e kowkowiah now mami re-e ang uowi mih kowtek pe diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Nakhowk khe Obadia tek pe mih, “Tawng angak chow ang changta khai? Tawng rakowi chow nakowngta ang kownkow ang kowh mangkri rut kowi en tuk ap ang khai? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />CHAKRAMANG en kowh masing Thurai ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. Nasaita en kownkow ang kowh mangkri krawi cham en dowi mih pren hai arah uowi dowi bowt. Now pren towng kowi kowh manguüa maten kowi paw amatni pren kowi en uowi dowi mih ang kowh mangkri pe takhamah khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Nami luk kowi ang kowh mangkri tut-e kowkowiah now mami re-e en uowi mih satang tak ü ang kowphowng pe kown? <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Mami hownia ang powt hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla tawng pra chow nacham pawla en kown mih mia chow tuk? Ang kowh mangkri kowi ang kowtek pe now ang kowh mangkri dow nauang mü en kown. Nakhowk khe ang kowh mangkri uang khi en dowi now kowngta ang dowi tham pabow? Nachenganchepaw ang dow asowmchow hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />CHAKRAMANG kowh risiuüa kowi Jezebel saiah mih khin khe tawng ngai chow ang chang mih en tuk nadowi bow? CHAKRAMANG kowh risiuüa 100 ia kowi changah pre bak now 50 ia chi puk kowi ang cham petah now ang peah chakkham mih en tuk nadowi bow? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Nami pache kawmat ang kowh mangkri tut-e kowkowi now mami re-e en uowi mih satang tak en kowpe phowng ang. Ang kowh mangkri saita ang dowi tham pabow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Nakhowk khe Elija klangah mih, “Ang chang pe lup reng mih CHAKRAMANG ang kowh masing Thurai ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. Ani dow Ahab pur kowi ang natatüng tangtang kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Nahanow Obadia dow mang Ahab tut-e kowkowiah now risi Elija hown natakrum kown mih laiklow kowtek pe khai. Now mang Ahab dow Elija hown kowtakrum khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baal risiuüa hown risi Elija taüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Elija kowi khita now Ahab tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowi towkah akrat pusa reng mih en chowbowt lownow!” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Elija klangah mih, “Israeluüa kowi towkah akrat pusa mih ang nadowi. Israeluüa kowi towkah akrat pusa mih dow en hai en pa krungchakuüa chowtaih. Enni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek nuata hanow akeng thuraiuüa kung cham krawi khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Kawmat mih kowchin maru hanow Israeluüa maten kowi Karmel hungh kowi nauang takua talawm kownkow krawi pe satang diah. Now Jezebel pawitang kowi kowh tawi cha tawi kham mih risiuüa 450 ia hai Asera thuraima kowh risiuüa 400 ia kowi paw uang hawla diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Naiawng rakowi Ahab mih Israeluüa maten hai Baal thurai kowh risiuüa hai Asera thuraima kowh risiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah now Karmel hungh kowi Elija tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Mün ni tak chow lawng pre buk kowi enni nachawp kown? CHAKRAMANG che Thurai chekhai hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi phai chup büa diah, now Baal thuraiuüa che Thurai chekhai hanow Baal thuraiuüa kowi phai chup büa diah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow miapaw lai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa kowi Elija tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh risiuüa maten kowi ang taih bowt ta lat mih uowi. Tawkche Baal thurai kowh risiuüa dow 450 ia tak chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Kawmat mih anging vüi uang pawla chiala pre pum büa diah. Now Baal thuraiuüa mih chiala pre pum hownia amatni vüi naruiah apum hanow anga tawp ia phuchuara kowi kowh sawp luk kowi pacham towah büah lah. Tawkchedow nami sawp kowi maih hown hang pacham towkah büah lah. Now alowk mih chiala dow ang nangenah hanow anga tawp ia mih phuchuara kowi kowh sawp luk kowi ang natowah kown. Tawkchedow ang paw maih hown ang natowkah kown nadowi. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi nahaw kown, now ang paw ang kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nahaw kown. Now amia kowh Thurai chow uang iu chin maih khai, nami Thurai chowtaih Thurai ching,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Nami laiklow tata hanow maru kawmuüa tek mih, “En tek mih lainowmma iung,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Now Baal thurai kowh risiuüa kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Enni dow maru iun lang kawm chedow chiala mih rik rui büah hanow phuchua müa rik kamrüt büah madiah. Now enni kowh thuraiuüa kowi haw büa diah. Tawkchedow maih hown enni naia towkah kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Now amatni ruiah mih chiala mih ngenah büah hanow changla phuchua kownkow kamrüt büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow rauchow hownia sat downg mowr amatni kowh Baal thurai kowi haw büah khai bowt. Amatni dow atün atünma tek mih, “Aw Baal thurai, uang klang anging diah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw miapaw uang klangah dowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow amatni thawpah mih phuchuara ria kowi tapat lut plaila sawm khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Sat downg khe Elija kowkowiah now Baal risiuüa kowi khareah se tek pe mih, “Atünma hawah büa diah! Aia dow thurai nadowi bow? Akeng mih lawnguan kowi aia cham tuak thüm nadowi ü? Nadowi now cham uat thüm nadowi ü? Nadowi now tiama kowi cham mang thüm nadowi ü? Nadowi now aia dow amüi thüm nadowi ü? Aia che müi thüm hanow enni akrüng takla,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow atün atünma kutplan hawah khai. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh ari kowi uowi iawng amatni buk kowi vi lawt pat saidawng hai saichow hown tata büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Naiawng hai amatni dow sat downg kowh iak pra kowh phuchua khin mowr chang büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow tawng iawng paw miapaw uang klangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Nakhowk khe maru maten kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Ang re-e uang büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow maru kawmuüa mih Elija re-e kowkowi khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara apiakma mih dow Elija plan rawah khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Aia dow Jakawb kowh chapauüa krungchak maten vüi lowk chi paw hua laipre buk khai. “En ming Israel naown kown,” pahai CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih nami Jakawb kowi chowbowt. <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Now naiawngün hua hown Elija mih CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp phuchuara lowk khai, now nami phuchuara tapat lut tui takowi laitali set mowr krawi thai pe kuam khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Nami kung kowi dow phuchuara luk kowi aia tang pe sawp hanow nami luk kowi tang pe chiala nga tawp ia khai. Now maru kawmuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tuikawng tali klüng hown cham towng tui büah hanow mami phuchua müa chaknga hai sawp luk kowi uang thut büa madiah,” pakhai. Now maru kawmuüa dow Elija tek iawng chang khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Nami kung kowi aia tek pe mih, “Thut büa iawk diah,” pakhai. Now maru kawmuüa dow Elija tek iawng chang khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Plan thut büa iawk diah,” pakhai. Now maru kawmuüa dow Elija tek pe iawng plan chang khai iawk. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Nakhowk khe phuchuara kowi kowh thutah mih tui dow ariaret kowi kowh thaiah mih kuam kowi iu hawk hanow tek mawp khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Now iak pra kowh phuchua khin uang ting khe dow risi Elija mih chup Thurai khai bowt. Aia awr tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, Abraham, Isak hai Israeluüa kowh Thurai. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi en chowtaih Thurai pami, ang dow en kowh nar pami hai maiawng ang chang mih dow en kowh ana pek chekhai pami maru kawmuüa kowi ani uang pe tukah diah. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Uang klang ang diah, aw CHAKRAMANG, uang klang ang diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chowtaih Thurai pami hai amatni kowh sak uang pe taplanah mih dow en chowtaih pami maiawngün maru maten natukla kownkow uang klang ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Nakhowk khe mukuang hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh maih uang iu dowh hanow phuchuara kowi kowh chaknga, sawp, hua hai bawn ün uang kamta bowk khai, now phuchuara ria kowi kowh thaiah mih kuam kowi kowh tui paw kang bowk khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Nami khita hanow maru kawmuüa dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se atünma tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai, CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Baal thurai kowh risiuüa kowi khüm büa madiah. Amatni kowi lowk ia paw hangkow pe powtah büah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow naiawngün risiuüa kowi khümta bowk khai. Now naiawngün risiuüa kowi mih Kisawn lawngrawi kowi kowpawla now Elija kowsaita bowk khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG uang chin pe uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Nami kung kowi Ahab kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Uangchak mang tün ang ta khowk. Naiawng rakowi rü now cham cha cham kham bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Naiawng rakowi Ahab dow rü now cham cha cham kham khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Elija dow Karmel hungh luk kowi kowpün khai, now tua kung se tabawkah krawm now chup Thurai khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Nami kung kowi aia kowh nar kowi Elija tek pe mih, “Kowkowiah now sata pra kowsam mü madiah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Elija kowh nar dow sata prakowi kowmü khai. Now Elija kowi uang tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw ang khi dowi,” pape khai. Naiawng hai anar kowi mih ranit kat mowr Elija kowpe müah khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Now ranit kat khe dow ki müla now Elija kowi anar uang tek pe mih, “Sata hownia rutpha khowtchow uangnim awr taken iek mih uowi lowk,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Nakhowk khe Elija tek pe mih, “Ahab tut-e kowkowiah now aia kowh kawrnga kari hown kim kowi namang kownkow kowtek pe diah, nadowi now uangchak hown aia takhang kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Nakhowk khe kuang dawng kowi uangnim akringma uang tatüng khai bowt, li paw uang tarowng uang khai bowt, now uangchak mang mih uang khai bowt. Now Ahab dow kawrnga kari hown Jezrel marow prakowi tarowng mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Nakhowk khe Thurai hownia kowh kür mih Elija tut-e uang ting khai. Aia dow aia kowh tawnguat mih kelang kowi sükla now Ahab dowi rawn kowrik iowm hanow Jezrel marow kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Jezebel hownia Elija powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Risi Elija changah mih lup lawnguan maten hai Baal thuraiuüa kowh risiuüa maten kowi saita pe mih lawnguan dow mang Ahab mih amasi Jezebel kowi lawpta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Naiawngün laiklow tata hanow Jezebel dow Elija tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Tharau kowh maiawng khin khe risiuüa kowi kowh en saiah iawng ang nasai en kown. Ang che sai en dowi hanow thuraiuüa mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Nami tata hanow Elija dow kram kowh aia kowh sak naplaila kownkow cham powt khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow Juda süng kowi kowh Ber-Seba marow kowi kowtowm khai, now anar kowi dow nakowi ta towla khai. <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Nachenganchepaw aiamat dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi pani mang rawng kowmang khai. Now aia dow nakowi kowh singh klim kowi kowchowm hanow aia kowi kowngta kown mih vüi chup Thurai khai. Aia chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, nakhowk tak. Khaleng dow iu pawta ang asak bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow ang kowh pipu-uüa lak-e lang iung dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Nami kung kowi aia dow nami singh klim kowi mawk hanow amüi khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Nami khin khe kramamu lowk ia dow aia kowi uang lowkah hanow tek pe mih, “Rü diah, now cha chakkham diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Now aia krawi tang mü hanow aia lu re-e hua den kowi kowh awpah mih kawmpah apah hai tui uowi pachawk mih aia khi khai. Nami chala khamla now aia dow plan müi khai iawk.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow Elija tut-e plan uang khai iawk. Nami kramamu dow Elija kowi lowkah se tek pe mih, “Rü diah, now cha chakkham diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en vüi dow en namangah kown mih tiama aiatma chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow awr rü hanow cha chakkham khai. Nami chakkham chata hanow aia mih ka kür khai, now aia dow 40 ni 40 uar mowr mang hanow Thurai kowh Sinai hungh kowi kowtowm khai. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Aia dow nami hungh kowi kowh puk kowi kowkup hanow hing iak khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1KI 19:9">Risi Elija tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Nakowi Elija uowi khe CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe mih, “Elija, mami re-e tawng chow en chang?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Nakhowk khe Elija klangah mih, “Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang dow en naka ringkawra kown mih lawnguan kowi lainowmma ang towk kür khai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow en kowh sangbowk laitawm nuata khai, en kowh phuchuara ün piakta büah bowk khai, now en kowh risiuüa kowi ün krawi saita büah bowk khai. Ta sing uowi mih dow ang malowkchow towbowt, now kawmat Israeluüa mih ang kowi paw nasaita ang kownkow sangkrang büah thüm chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Puk hownia uang lawt now hungh luk kowi ang pur kowi uang iowng diah,” pakhai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow nami arah pur iawng haimang khai. Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi dow liku mang uang hanow hungh ün talak khai, now singku huamang ün dow tadi iawm khai. Nachenganchepaw nami liku kowi dow CHAKRAMANG uowi dowi chekhai. Liku kung kowi dow lihowng uang khai. Nachenganchepaw nami lihowng kowi paw CHAKRAMANG uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Nami lihowng kung kowi dow maih uang ting khai. Tawkchedow nami maih kowi paw CHAKRAMANG uowi dowi chekhai. Nami maih kung kowi dow laiklow klamchow mih aia ta khai. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Nami klow tata hanow Elija dow aia kowh uanpowngchow hown mumta lumowr khai, now aia dow prang kowi lawt hanow puk mowr re-e uang iowng khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Elija mih, “Elija, mami re-e tawng chow en chang?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Nakhowk khe Elija klangah mih, “Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang dow en naka ringkawra kown mih lawnguan kowi lainowmma ang towk kür khai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow en kowh sangbowk laitawm nuata khai, en kowh phuchuara ün piakta büah bowk khai, now en kowh risiuüa kowi ün krawi saita büah bowk khai. Ta sing uowi mih dow ang malowkchow towbowt, now kawmat Israeluüa mih ang kowi paw nasaita ang kownkow sangkrang büah thüm chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En uang tarüla mih tiama iawng plan hanow Damaska marow kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi en kowting hanow Siria pren kowi nachowm mang kownkow Hazael kowi nümnapah diah. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Nami klen kowi Nimsi kowh chu Jehu kowi paw Israel pren kowi nachowm mang kownkow nümnapah diah, now en kowh arah kowi nata chang risi lup kownkow Abel-Mehola marowchak Safat chapa Elisa kowi nümnapah diah. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Hazael saidawng hownia kowh plai miuüa kowi dow Jehu nasaita kown, now Jehu saidawng hownia kowh plai miuüa kowi dow Elisa nasaita kown. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Nachenganchepaw Baal thurai pur kowi tawi tabawk dowi mih hai nami arup kowi tawi nam dowi mih Israeluüa kowi dow ang lang towta 7,000 ia khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisa kowi Thurai hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Akung kowi Elija dow nami hownia powt hanow Safat chapa Elisa hown takrum khai. Nami khin khe Elisa dow chiala pachum hown hawt thawn laih khai. Now aia pur kowi dow akeng mih maru-uüa mih chiala lailowk chum hown thawn laih khai. Now Elisa re-e Elija kowkowiah hanow aia kowh uanpowngchow mih Elisa pangkawt kowi haipai pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Nahanow Elisa dow aia kowh chiala ta towla hüah now Elija kung tawi krawi khai. Elisa tek pe mih, “Au hai apa iüah kowi ang kownamla tak. Nami kung kowi dow en tut-e ang tawi kown taih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Nakhowk khe Elija tek pe mih, “Ow, kowkowi bowt. Tawkche en nauang plan kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang pai en uanpowngchow mih lup dow pankrima chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Naiawng rakowi Elisa dow aia kowh chiala uowi rah re-e uang plan khai. Now aia kowh chiala pachum dow ngenah hanow thawpla laih thawn tim mih singh hown engah khai, now nami chaknga dow maru kawmuüa cha khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Elija tut-e kowtawi khai, now Elija kowh lup chang mih tawi chowng khai.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ben-Hadad chang bawri mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Siria pren mang Ben-Hadad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben-Hadad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 1Manguüa 15:18 kowi kowh Ben-Hadad chünchü mih hai 2Manguüa 13:3 kowi kowh Ben-Hadad chünchü mih chim dowi chekhai. </char></note> mih Israeluüa kowi nasenah kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Aia dow mang 32 ia, kawrnga hai kawrnga kari ahuma pawla now Israel kowi kowh marow kri Samari kowi nakowsenah kownkow kowrumta lut khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Nakhowk khe Ben-Hadad mih Samari marow kowi kowh mang Ahab tut-e kowchin maru pre sum ia hanow tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />“En kowh kuh hai tai mih ang kowh, now en kowh masi klangiungma miuüa hai en kowh chauüa paw ang kowh,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa kowi Israel mang Ahab hawt klangah mih, “Ang tek khowk, ang kowh mangkri tek mih na nowm. Ang hai ang kowh uowi mih maten dow aia kowh chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Nami kung kowi Ben-Hadad mih kowchin maru hanow Ahab kowi tek pe iawk mih, “En kowh kuh hai tai hown en kowh masi chauüa nape ang kown mih ang tek en khowk. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Nachenganchepaw tharau kowh maiawng khin khe dow ang kowh maru iukuüa kowi ang nauang chin en kown. Amatni dow en kowh kim kowi hai en kowh maru iukuüa kim kowi nauang krawi phui kown, now en mik kowi kowh asung uowima mih uanh maten napawla en bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Nakhowk khe dow mang Ahab mih Israel pren kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa maten kowi hawah khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Mü büa madiah. Ben-Hadad mih ang kowh kuh hai tai hown masi chauüa kowi aia kowi napeah kownkow uang tek ang khe ang nauta pe khowk. Nachenganchepaw aia dow nachang ang angak kownkow kamrüt reng tak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Nakhowk khe lawngtang aluchowuüa hai maru maten tek pe mih, “Ben-Hadad kowh laiklow hangkow sünta reng, now aia tek en mih paw hangkow nauta pe,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Naiawng rakowi Behadad kowh maru-uüa kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Ang kowh mangkri kowi kowtek pe büa diah. Aia uang rik tekah mih iawng dow ang nachang pe kown taih. Tawkche uang ta tekah mih iawng dow ang ia chang dowi tham,” pakhai. Now nami laiklow nakowtek pe kownkow naiawngün maru-uüa dow Ben-Hadad tut-e kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Nakhowk khe Ahab kowi Ben-Hadad uang krawi tek pe mih, “Sünta, ang kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi pachawm chi naret pe kown mih dinchow khowm uowi dowi pat Samari marow kowi ang piakah kown. Naiawng che ang chang dowi hanow ang kowh thuraiuüa mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Nakhowk khe Ahab krawi klangah mih, “Dowk tasen kownkow kawmat pat saidawng hown dowm dowi tak mih pache tasen awng kowh uang plan mih maru iawng hang pacham chang bawri lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Nami satang phowng miuüa Ben-Hadad tut-e kowting mih khin khe Ben-Hadad hai akeng mih manguüa dow amatni kowh tangbung kowi kham rak büah thüm chekhai. Nami satang tata hanow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi aia peah ana mih, “Cham dowk tasen kownkow kamrüt büah bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Samari marow kowi nakowsen kownkow kamrüt khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahab tut-e Ben-Hadad sum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Nami khin khe Israel pren mang Ahab tut-e risi uang towm lowk ia khai. Nami risi uang tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Paimi siphai kawm en khi tak bow? Ani dow kowbüah kowi en rut kowi ang naap-ah kown, now ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Nakhowk khe Ahab lüntaah mih, “Nachenganchepaw mia hown chow naiawng CHAKRAMANG nachangah kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Risi klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek pren kruitown miuüa dak kowi kowh uowi mih siphai klanguüa hawmh pe nachang kown,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Ahab lüntaah mih, “Mia chow narik tarowng tasen kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Risi klangah mih, “En narik tarowng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Nami laiklow tata now Ahab mih pren kruitown miuüa dak kowi kowh uowi mih siphai klanguüa hawmh 232 ia kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Israel siphaiuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow maru iun 7,000 chowng büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16-17" />Nami kung kowi dow sat downg now lawt büah khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni dow pren kruitown miuüa dak kowi kowh uowi mih siphai klanguüa hawmh kowi rik pe mangah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:16-17">Nami khin khe Ben-Hadad hai aia hown kowh manguüa 32 ia dow tangbung khupra kowi pua khowk chepaw kham rak reng tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe krawi paw satang kownkow Ben-Hadad kowchinah mih maru uang plan hanow uang tek pe mih, “Samari marow hownia Israeluüa uang tarü khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Nakhowk khe Ben-Hadad tek mih, “Nauang thawp taking tasangra kownkow amatni uang mih chepaw asing a-i nakhümah kown, now nauang dowk tasen kownkow uang mih chekhai chepaw amatni kowi asing a-i nakhümah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Nakhowk khe pren kruitown miuüa dak kowi kowh uowi mih siphai klanguüa hawmh dow uang dowk tasen khai bowt, now amatni kung kowi Israel siphai hawmh paw uang tawi krawi khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Nami khin khe Israel siphaiuüa dow amatni chowlowkkow hown kowh tasen mih ransu kowi nowngta khai. Nami khita hanow Siriauüa dow powt khai bowt, now Israeluüa dow amatni kung kowi kawikrawiah khai. Nachenganchepaw mang Ben-Hadad dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih aia kowh siphai pre sum ia kowi pawla now kawrnga hown powt khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Israel pren mang dow uangah hanow ta lawt mih kawrnga kowi saita bowk khai, ta lawt mih kawrnga kari kowi piakta bowk khai, now Siriauüa kowi sai chamang uang saiah khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Nami kung kowi nami risi mih Israel pren mang tut-e uang khai iawk. Nami risi uang tek pe mih, “Uang talen mih chungrau khin kung kowi Siria pren mang nauang sen en iawk kown. Naiawng rakowi tawng chow achang takla mih paw tuak kaneu diah, now en kowh siphaiuüa kowi akhawtma thawpah ngamlam diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Ben-Hadad plan senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Nami khin khe Siria pren mang kowh maru iukuüa Ben-Hadad kowi peah prengia mih, “Israeluüa kowh thuraiuüa dow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh thuraiuüa chekhai. A-i lak-e Israeluüa lang kür mih dow naiawng rakowi chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw anaima mih süng kowi che a-i senah now amatni lak-e a-i nalang kür ngengche kown. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Naiawng rakowi maiawng chang diah: Mang 32 ia mih kowi towta hanow amatni takcha kowi siphai aluchowuüa kowi pawah diah. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Nami klen kowi en mata mih siphai iun khowt kutplan thawp siphai hawmh pathum diah. Now en mata mih kawrnga hai kawrnga kari khowt kutplan kamrüt kawrnga hai kawrnga kari iawk diah. Nahanow anaima mih süng kowi Israeluüa kowi a-i senah khe a-i naawng kown towbowt. Nakhowk khe dow Israeluüa lak-e a-i nalang kür tangtang,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Ben-Hadad dow nauta khai, now aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe iawng chang khai bowt.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Now auai ning kowh chungrau khin kung kowi mang Ben-Hadad mih Siriauüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai bowt, now Israeluüa kowi nasenah kownkow Afek marow kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa paw takua talawm khai. Amatni kowh chakkham kamrütla now amatni paw Siriauüa hown tadowk tasen kownkow tarü khai bowt. Israeluüa mih Siriauüa kowh tangbung khupra pur kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. Israeluüa kowi dow müah khe thum chalachow mih rua hawmh iawng uowi pre thumchow chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Siriauüa dow pasüngma tek mawp chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Nakhowk khe nami risi uangah now Israel mang kowi uang tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Siriauüa tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow hungh kowi kowh Thurai taih, lawngrawi kowi kowh Thurai nadowi,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Siriauüa kowh siphai hawmh akawmma mih kowi en rut kowi ang naap en kown. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Naiawng hai ranit ni mowr amatni dow tatingtang klowk khup tangbung büah khai. Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow tarowng tasen büah khai bowt. Nami ni pani sang khawk hown kowh mang mih Siria siphai 100,000 ia kowi Israeluüa saiah khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Now akeng mih Siria siphaiuüa dow Aphek marow kowi kowpowt khai. Aphek marow kowi powt miuüa dow marow tap chan kowh maru iun 27,000 ia kowng khai. Now Ben-Hadad paw Afek marow kowi kowpowt now kim lowk mih kowi kowh towklak kowi kowtapet khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Ben-Hadad kowi aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Mangkri, Israel manguüa dow saksing sanara atekma pami anging ta. Naiawng rakowi kelang kowi bawmla sala uan hanow lu kowi piala leng now Israel mang tut-e pe kowi anging madiah. Nahanow aia dow sai en dowi tham chepaw naia,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kelang kowi bawmla sala uan hanow lu kowi piala leng khai, now Israel mang tut-e kowkowi khai bowt. Now Israel mang kowi kowtek pe büah mih, “En kowh nar Ben-Hadad tek mih sakrauma hown aia kowi hangkow saiah diah pe,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Nakhowk khe Israel mang klangah mih, “Kawmat paw aia sing reng tak bow? Aia dow ang tainau le,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa dow iung mih chowbowt pahai ka tuak kowh lenlenma tek pe mih, “Ow le, Ben-Hadad dow en tainau reng towbowt le,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Mang Ahab tek pe mih, “Kowkowiah now Ben-Hadad kowi uang pawla büa diah,” pakhai. Ben-Hadad uang towm khe aia kowi dow kawrnga kari luk kowi Ahab tangla now pawla khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Now Ben-Hadad tek pe Ahab mih, “En pa hownia kowh apa pawah mih kua maten ang plan peta en iawk kown. Now Samari marow kowi apa krawi thawp chi iawng dow en paw Damaska marow kowi en nakrawi ia thawp chi kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Nakhowk khe Ahab tek pe mih, “Naiawng che en chang hanow ang nalawtta en kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng hai aia dow Ben-Hadad hown tatow sangbowk laitawm kung kowi Ben-Hadad kowi lawtta khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahab kowh atawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng risiuüa pungmadawng kowi lowk ia mih risi mih aia kowh auiua kowi tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown bawpta ang naknak dit,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh auiua dow aia kowi nau bawpah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Nakhowk khe nami risi tek pe a-auiua mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow en chün dowi rakowi ang hownia en powt hown krowksang krangsi namak en hanow nakowngta kown,” pakhai. Now nami risi auiua dow powt hanow aia kowi mih krangsi makah now kowng khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Nami kung kowi nami risi mih kutplan khi maru lowk ia iawk. Nami maru kowi nami risi tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown bawpta ang naknak dit,” pakhai. Nahanow nami maru dow nami risi kowi bawpta naknak khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Nami kung kowi dow nami risi mih tiama ria kowi hawt iowng hanow mang Ahab kowi hawt chawngah khai. Aia dow aia kowi mang hang pacham tuk matah lah pakowh bawmla mik khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Now nami tiama iawng mang uang mang khe nami risi hawt hawah now tek pe mih, “En kowh nar ang mih tasenra dawng kowi kowkowi chowdiah. Nakhowk khe maru lowk ia mih aia cham khümah mih maru lowk ia kowi ang tut-e uang pawla khai, now tek ang mih, ‘Mami maru kowi hawt ming dit. Mami maru che tama now aia kowh sak takcha en kowh sak ang napawta en kown, nadowi now tai 40 set en naiaw kown takla,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Nachenganchepaw akeng lup kowi en kowh nar ang pusa thüm khe nami maru dow tawng pra chü cham powt khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Nakhowk khe mang Ahab tek pe mih, “Nami ripra dow en naka kown mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow en matia nawr hown en tek khowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Nakhowk khe nami risi dow aia kowh mik mih alenma lowtta khai. Nahanow mang Ahab mih nami maru kowi risi pami tukta khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Now Ahab kowi nami risi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ang napiakah kownkow ang peah piati mih maru kowi en lawtta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh sak takcha en kowh sak ang napawta en kown, now aia kowh maru-uüa sak takcha kowi en kowh maru-uüa kowh sak ang napawta kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Ahab dow sak-hiah lai kowh lumowr anumma phaw khai, now Samari marow kowi aia kim kowi mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Nabawt kowh grep krum Ahab khünta pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Jezrel marow kowi Nabawt pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia kowh dow grep krum uowi lowk chekhai. Nami grep krum dow Jezrel marow kowi kowh Samari marow mang Ahab kim re-e chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Akat khe Ahab tek pe Nabawt mih, “En kowh grep krum dow ang kim re-e chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang nachangla kan eng khang kownkow en kowh grep krum peta ang towbowt. Nami takcha kowi nami lak-e kowh iung mih grep krum ang pe en parah kown towbowt, nadowi now asung takla iawng ang pe en kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Nachenganchepaw Nabawt klangah mih, “Nami grep krum dow ang pipu-uüa hownia kowh ang kaah mih chekhai. Nami che ang peta en hanow CHAKRAMANG mih pacham pe ang piati lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Naiawng Nabawt tek pe rakowi Ahab dow lumowr khüptürma hai atawm kunmarau hown kim kowi mang khai. Aia dow kowmawk hanow kimbang prakowi cham dangta lumowr khai, now cha dowi kham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Nakhowk khe Ahab kowi amasi Jezebel lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en sak nga khai? Tawngplawng kowchow en cha en kham dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Ahab klangah mih, “Nabawt kowi aia kowh grep krum nasumta ang kown mih ang tek pe chowdiah, nadowi now aia kowh grep krum takcha akeng mih grep krum peah kown mih ang tek pe chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh grep krum nape ang dowi kown mih tek ang khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Nakhowk khe amasi tek pe aia mih, “En nadowi bow Israel pren mang? Rü now cha chakkham diah, now piaw diah. Nabawt kowh grep krum ang pe en sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Nami kung kowi Jezebel dow ahua Ahab ming hown rui chasak sangrum khai, now naiawngün chasak kowi ahua kowh <char style="w">mur</char> tuk pe khai. Naiawngün dow Nabawt uowiah mih marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai maru iukuüa tut-e aia krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Naiawngün chasak kowi aia krawi rui pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow pe khangah hawm büa diah, now Nabawt kowi mih ringkawra uowima mih arah kowi pe chowmah büa diah. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Nabawt hown tatang klowk maru ngak pre ia kowi pe chowmah diah. Now Thurai hai mang kowi Nabawt peah piati pahai amatchi kowi pe thuakah saksi diah. Nami kung kowi dow Nabawt kowi mih marow uat kowi cham pawla hanow kowng pat huaklu hown kuakah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Naiawng rakowi Nabawt uowi rah marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai maru iukuüa mih Jezebel chasak kowi kowh arui uowi mih ana iawng chang khai. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Amatni dow nakhang hawm kownkow takua talawm büah khai, now Nabawt kowi ringkawra uowima mih arah kowi pe chowmah büah khai. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Nami kung kowi maru ngak pre ia dow uang hanow Nabawt pur kowi uang chowm khai. Now amatchi dow Nabawt lawnguan kowi uang thuak saksi mih, “Nabawt dow Thurai hai mang kowi peah rukrai khai,” pakhai. Nahanow maru kawmuüa mih marow uat kowi Nabawt kowi cham pawla hanow kowng pat huaklu hown kuakah khai. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Nami kung kowi dow huaklu hown kuakah kowh Nabawt kowi kowngta khowk pami satang nami lawngtang aluchowuüa mih Jezebel kowi krawi phowng pe khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Nabawt kowi huaklu hown kuakah kowh kowngta khowk pami satang tata hown krowksang Jezebel tek pe Ahab mih, “Nabawt kowng tüng khowk. Aia nau sum en dowi mih aia kowh grep krum kowpowngta bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Nami satang tata hanow Ahab dow Nabawt kowh grep krum nakowpowng kownkow kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Nakhowk khe Tisbe marowchak Elija tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang towm khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Samari marow kowi Israel pren mang Ahab hown kowtakrum diah. Aia dow kawmat Nabawt kowh grep krum kowi chekhai. Nakowi aia uang mih dow nami grep krum nauang powng kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Ang CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow Ahab kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Nabawt kowi saita hanow aia kowh grep krum en powngta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Nabawt kowh vi kui hawmh bia pe mih rah re-e en kowh vi kui hawmh nabia en kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Elija kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Ang kowh ransu, en krumta ang khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Elija klangah mih, “Ow, ang krumta en mih chowbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup nachang kownkow en matia kowi en tape khai. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek en mih, ‘En luk kowi ang nauang pawla en phih kown. En kowi mih asaima ang napiakta en kown. En krungchak kachakuüa maten kowi nar lah, nar nadowi mih lah ang nasaita bowk kown. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />En krungchak kowi mih Nabawt chapa Jeroboam krungchak hai Ahija chapa Basa krungchak kowi iawng ang napiakah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en towk ang kunmarau khai, now Israeluüa kowi en pe changah angak khai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Elija plan tek mih, “Jezebel lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En masi Jezebel kowi paw Jezrel marow tap re-e kui hawmh nachaah kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Marow kowi kowh kowng mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi dow kui nachaah kown, now marow uat kowi kowh kowng miuüa kowi dow uakling uaber hawmh nachawtah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Jezebel chükah rakowi Ahab dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup nachang kownkow tape khai. Aia iawng khowt chang lup ngak mih maru dow miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Ahab dow Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih Amawruüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren kowi tawi chupiia khai.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow tata hanow Ahab mih aia kowh tawnguat thekta hanow klüpta khai, now khup sala uan hanow <char style="w">khang hawm</char> khai. Aia dow sala uan khupma hown mawk khai, now cham len khe paw saktuak piak rakowi pawplachow chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Nakhowk khe Tisbe marowchak Elija kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Ang pur kowi Ahab uang khamsum khamdaw mih en khi nadowi bow? Naiawng aia uang khamsum khamdaw khai rakowi mami phih mih aia chownglawng kowi ang nauang pawla pe kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw achapa chowng kowi dow aia krungchakuüa luk kowi mami phih ang nauang pawla pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ahab kowh risi iuauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Siriauüa hai Israeluüa dow sum ning mowr mih tasen büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Now sum ning mih ning khe dow Juda pren mang Jehosafat mih Israel pren mang Ahab hown kowtakrum khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Nami khin khe aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi Israel mang tek pe mih, “Ramawt-Gilead süng a-i kowh pami enni tuk tak bow? Tawkchedow nami süng mih Siria pren mang hownia nakala kownkow tawngpaw a-i chang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4-5" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ramawt-Gilead kowi kowsen kown mih ang hown en tawi tak ü?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4-5">Nakhowk khe Jehosafat klangah mih, “Tawng tawi dowi chow? Ang kowh maru-uüa hai ang kowh kawrnga hawmh dow en kowh iawng tuakah towbowt. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tut-e rik paw prengia diah sik,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Naiawng rakowi Ahab mih risi maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nakhowk khe risiuüa uang takua talawm mih dow maru iun 400 ia ngia chekhai. Now naiawngün risiuüa kowi Ahab lüntaah mih, “Ramawt-Gileaduüa kowi ang kowsen kown bow, kowsen dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Nakhowk khe risiuüa klangah mih, “Kowsen bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami süng dow en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG naap en kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Nachenganchepaw Jehosafat tek pe mih, “Nami lawnguan CHAKRAMANG tut-e naia lüntaah kownkow mami re-e CHAKRAMANG kowh risi uowi dowi bowt bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG tut-e naia lüntala kownkow risi uowi lowk ia tak. Tawkchedow nami risi kowi ang sui chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami risi mih ang nangala kown mih lawnguan kangowh tek; aia mih katpaw ang iung müa laiklow tek dowi. Aia ming dow Mikha, now a-pa ming dow Imla chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Nakhowk khe Jehosafat klangah mih, “Mangkri, naiawng mih laiklow hang tek snow,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iuk lowk ia kowi hawah now Ahab tek pe mih, “Kawmat alenma Imla kowh chapa risi Mikha kowi kowhaw madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Now Israel pren mang Ahab hai Juda pren mang Jehosafat iüah mih khupla mang tawnguat now Samari marow tapplawt re-e kowh püm thuara kowi kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm iüah khai, now risiuüa dow amatchi pur kowi pur pra kowh naphaw kown mih laiklow tekla prung khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Nakhowk khe Kenana kowh chapa Zedekia mih lawngha hown thawp nang lowk hanow tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek Siriauüa chum bowk dowi mowr maiawngün lawngha nang hown en nakrawi tingah rengreng kown pe,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Nakhowk khe akeng mih risiuüa paw nami laiklow powm iawng tawi tek khai. Naiawngün risiuüa tek mih, “Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi kowsenah bowt, en awng kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow dow CHAKRAMANG mih naap en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahab kowi kingküala mih laiklow Mikha tek mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Now Mikha kowi kowhaw mih maru tek pe Mikha mih, “Sünta, akeng mih risiuüa dow mangkri iung müa lawnguan kowi tek bowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en paw kowbüah iawng natawi tek kown takla; mangkri iung müa lawnguan chowtaih en natawi tek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Nachenganchepaw Mikha tek pe mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. CHAKRAMANG tek mih chowtaih ang natek kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Now Mikha uang ting khe mang Ahab hawt lüntaah mih, “Mikha, tek ang madiah. Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi ang kowsen kown bow, kowsen dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Nakhowk khe Mikha klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen bowt, kowsen bowt, en awng kown taih. Nami marow dow en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta khowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Nakhowk khe Ahab tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG ming hown takham se lainowm chowtaih en natek kown pami mün kat tak chow ang natek en kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Mikha klangah mih, “Mukmang kowi ang khi mih, Israel siphaiuüa dow athing mih uowi dowi mih ruapur hawmh iawng hungh kowi cham tauet plawt khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Naiawngün siphaiuüa kowh aluchow uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni mih chowlowkkow kim kowi pacham mang lah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Khi bow kow! Nami risi dow ang nangala kown mih laiklow klen kowi tawngpaw tek dowi pami ang tek en khowk nadowi bow kow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Now Mikha plan tek iawk mih, “CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah. <char style="w">Mukmang</char> kowi ang khi mih, aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi CHAKRAMANG chowm phülü khai, now aia hawmlawm hai lakuai pra dow kramamu-uüa maten iowngla rim khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ahab kowi kuanla now Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi nakowngta kownkow amia chow nakowkuanah kown?’ pakhai. Nakhowk khe kramamu-uüa mih lowk ia e achap chi CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Nachenganchepaw achur kowi lümla lowk mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uangah now uang tek pe mih, ‘Ang kowkuanah now ang kowpawla sow,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG lüntaah mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow en nachangah kown?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">“Nami lümla klangah mih, ‘Ang kowkowiah now aia kowh risiuüa tut-e nadaila kown mih lümla ang nakowchowng pe kown,’ pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">“Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, ‘En naia nowm kown, kowkowi now kowkuanah dit,’ pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih kawmat en kowh naiawngün risi maten nawr kowi natek dai lai kown mih lümla peah mih chekhai. En napiak kownkow CHAKRAMANG phuangta khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Nakhowk khe Kenana kowh chapa Zedekia mih Mikha kowi phekah pawp now tek pe mih, “En hown nauang taklang kownkow ang hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh Lümla powt mih tawng khe chowbowt chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Now Mikha klangah mih, “Natapet kownkow kim lak kowi en cham kup mih khin khe nami dow en natuk kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi mang Ahab peah ana mih, “Marow kowi kowh kruitown mih Amawn hai mang chapa Joas tut-e Mikha kowi kowsaah dit. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Now enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Mangkri tek mami maru kowi thawng kowi towah dit pe, now tasenra hownia klangiungma mangkri uang plan dowi mowr mami maru kowi mih kawm hai tui ditchowchi klen kowi tawngpaw hangkow peah pe,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Nakhowk khe mang Ahab kowi Mikha tek pe mih, “En che klangiungma uang ia plan khai hanow ang hownia CHAKRAMANG tek lai dowi pami tukah diah,” pape khai. Nami klen kowi maru kawmuüa kowi Mikha plan tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk ang kowh laiklow matah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi Ahab kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Nami kung kowi dow Israel pren mang hai Juda pren mang mih Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi kowsenah kownkow tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Maru natuk matla ang dowi kownkow tasenra kowi iawngpa mih tawnguat khupma ang natawi kown. Nachenganchepaw en dow mang tawnguat khupla diah,” pakhai. Now Israel mang dow iawngpa mih tawnguat khupma tasenra kowi tawi tarü khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Now kawrnga kari kowi kowh chowm mih aia kowh siphai aluchow 32 ia kowi Siriauüa kowh mang peah ana mih, “Israel mang hown klen kowi aiuk asowm mia hown paw enni naia tasen kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Now tasen thüm khe Jehosafat kowi Siriauüa kowh siphai aluchowuüa khita kowh Israel mang chowbowt padow ka tuak büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jehosafat kowi kowsenah khai. Nakhowk khe Jehosafat dow atünma hawt tüng klow khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Nahanow Israel mang nadowi pami Siriauüa kowh siphai aluchowuüa tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jehosafat kowi krawi senah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Nachenganchepaw Siriauüa kowh siphai lowk ia dow tawngah kaneu dowi kowi aia kowh leba vüiah now plawtta suat khai. Now nami leba sek dow Ahab sakmowr dakchow kowi kowtatawng khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh kawrnga kari te mih kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Ang ka arau khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi kawrnga kari planah now tasenra hownia powtla ang bowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Naiawng hown Siriauüa hai Israeluüa dow ni chut tasen khai. Now mang Ahab kowi dow Siriauüa hown tatang klowk kawrnga kari kowi chowmta hüah khai. Nami khin khe aia kowh leba sek kakra hownia vi hawk kowh kawrnga kari phai kowi tachun hüah khai, now iak prakowi dow mang Ahab mih kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Now sat kup kown chowbowt khe siphaiuüa tek mih, “A-i chowlowkkow kim prakowi a-i mang towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Naiawng hai Israel mang Ahab dow kowng khai. Now aia kowh uak dow Samari marow kowi uang pawla hanow nakowi maru dupah khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Aia kowh kawrnga kari dow Samari marow kowi kowh kanh kowi sauah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk iawng aia kowh vi dow kui hawmh mih bia pe khai, now chawkkrawmauüa mih nami kanh kowi tasawk tasau büah reng khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Ahab kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, ngasai sa hown kowh aia thawpah mih kim lawnguan hai akhawtma aia thawpla mih marow lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahab kowng kung kowi dow aia takcha achapa Ahazia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehosafat chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Juda pren kowi Asa kowh chapa Jehosafat chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Ahab chowm mang mih tali ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Jehosafat dow 35 ning khe uown chowm mang khai, now 25 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Aia kowh u ming dow Azuba chekhai, now Azuba kowh u ming dow Silhi chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Jehosafat dow lowra tia kowi a-pa Asa iawng chekhai. Aia dow katpaw a-pa changah mih sia nuata dowi. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang khai. Nachenganchepaw arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara aia krawi piakta dowi tak chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Aia dow Israel mang Ahab hown taking tasangra paw thawp khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Jehosafat kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai aia awng tasen mih lawnguan dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Aia dow a-pa Asa chowm mang kung kowi phuchuara kowi chang chawkkrawma lup mih maten kowi pren hownia prütta bowk khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Nami khin khe Edawm pren kowi mang uowi dowi chekhai. Nakowi kowh kruitown pren mih dow mang kowh maru iuk chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Nami klen kowi Ofir süng hownia nauang pawla kuh kownkow Jehosafat mih thawp chawnlawng sangrum chekhai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün chawnlawng dow Eziawn-Geber pami arah kowi piak kowh cham nowng paw kuh dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab kowh chapa Ahazia tek pe mih, “Ang kowh maru-uüa mih en kowh chawnlawng hown pacham tawi mang lah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Jehosafat nauta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Akung kowi Jehosafat dow kowng hanow David kowh marow kowi maru dupah khai. Now aia takcha kowi aia kowh chapa Jehoram mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Ahazia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Israel pren kowi Ahab kowh chapa Ahazia chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Jehosafat chowm mang mih lairanit ning khe chekhai. Aia dow Israeluüa luk kowi pre ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow a-u Jezebel iawng, a-pa Ahab iawng hai Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam iawng rowprowp chekhai. Aia dow Jeroboam iawng rowprowp Israeluüa kowi pe changah angak khai. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Aia dow Baal thurai pur kowi tabawk reng chekhai, now chupiia paw chupiiaah reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia paw a-pa chang iawng rowprowp tawi chang hanow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>